e":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、歩き出す。僕は、その後をついていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1103.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"447556B9-72DB-40EE-B13A-DEAEA633AD36","title":"シーン 1104","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1104スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それから、彼女と共に大学病院に来ると、彼女はこの受付で待つように言い、どこかへと去っていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1104.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg"},{"id":"C7FEBFA8-7C50-46C7-A90D-5A986261EC6B","title":"シーン 1105","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1105スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、数分待っていると、ある女性がやってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1105.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg"},{"id":"82005B50-466F-4C2C-AA55-FC615A9BBC4A","title":"シーン 1106","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1106スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"八意永琳","telop":"「こんにちは、紅夢くん。今日は来てくれて、ありがとね。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1106.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/永琳（微笑）.png"},{"id":"9CFCF6D7-2C9C-4ED8-87B2-3FEF07AEF744","title":"シーン 1107","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1107スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いえ、いえ。それで僕に今日は、どんな用があるのですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1107.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/永琳（微笑）.png"},{"id":"34EFD66A-6702-465D-AEDA-60A9A4047CB1","title":"シーン 1108","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1108スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"八意永琳","telop":"「最近の、君の様子を聞かせてくれるかね？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1108.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/永琳（微笑）.png"},{"id":"D5458E5B-576E-43DC-B564-6B032A1C4335","title":"シーン 1109","duration":3.6,"slideTitle":"第1109スライド","backgroundName":"nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、もちろん。」\n僕はそう返すと、彼女と共に診察室に向かって移動した。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1109.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc483926_病院の受付のイラスト.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/永琳（微笑）.png"},{"id":"937FFCFC-B0CD-4D3D-A66A-349F220F4CD6","title":"シーン 1110","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1110スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、あれからここ最近の出来事を淡々と話し、診察が終わると、続けて、ある検査を受けて、今は病室で休んでいた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1110.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png"},{"id":"FD5664F1-3DD1-491E-AB0F-E3C5A4F21630","title":"シーン 1111","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1111スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"今日は、彼女に今晩は病院で過ごすように言われ、フランたちのところには戻らず、そのまま明日登校することになった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1111.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png"},{"id":"04FEFF2E-5654-4F33-B4C7-058AAC094693","title":"シーン 1112","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1112スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、一人病室で、窓から見える景色をただ眺めていた。\nすると、病室の扉が突如として開き、誰かが入ってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1112.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png"},{"id":"A9C08DFD-EBB1-40D6-A918-D338B83F40D0","title":"シーン 1113","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1113スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「母さん、何かあったの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1113.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"EC9FFD5E-E738-4CD0-B991-23C7C44DFE7B","title":"シーン 1114","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1114スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「ねぇ、あんた、スカーレット姉妹から何か聞かされたの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1114.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"4B0B5B43-6B37-4584-AC73-E336B76E7E3E","title":"シーン 1115","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1115スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ、何も聞いてないけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1115.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"6703E172-88B8-40AE-A899-06AEC5E4D43F","title":"シーン 1116","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1116スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「念のために聞くけど、この書類にサインしたのはあんた？」\n私はそう言い、家に送られてきた婚姻届の控を出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1116.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"F57D1255-6D92-4328-90B5-91A8E4002AF8","title":"シーン 1117","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1117スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が出した書類をじっくりと見る。それは、婚姻届で、片方には、フランの名前が、もう片方には僕の名前があった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1117.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"5B87497D-740C-4683-8733-18391A9A9F91","title":"シーン 1118","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1118スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いや、知らない。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1118.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"04D92E40-7DE8-485A-80E8-F99612C1C563","title":"シーン 1119","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1119スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「そう。ところで、今朝のニュース、見たかしら？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1119.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"ABCCB320-3B1B-4135-8A59-E995CFA796F1","title":"シーン 1120","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1120スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ニュース？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1120.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"A1183DEB-6FEC-4332-8CFF-88C4C3340556","title":"シーン 1121","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1121スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「知らないの？とりあえずテレビつけて見なさい。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1121.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"1BCD4980-CBA2-4F62-A620-9456FDB252BA","title":"シーン 1122","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1122スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、後ろにあるテレビをつける。すると、そこには、月明かりが照らす空を飛ぶ、レミリアの姿があった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1122.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"FCFDFC50-F8DA-4F05-A59F-EBA354435C68","title":"シーン 1123","duration":1.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"image56.pxd","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1123.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image56.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.pxd","animationDuration":1.0},{"id":"6131AFF3-2808-4D54-8874-9085597C9028","title":"シーン 1124","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1124スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ハッと気がつくと、彼女が暗い表情で、僕に声をかけていた。「ごめん…、母さん…。」僕は反射的に、そう謝る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1124.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖顔２.png"},{"id":"0E08E038-2D8C-49B2-9294-BDCF8A5F0F17","title":"シーン 1125","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1125スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「謝る必要はないわよ。それよりも、あんたは大丈夫なの、さっきより顔色が悪くなっているけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1125.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖顔２.png"},{"id":"193E3E78-84DD-49AE-B45A-14BFD3AA7B76","title":"シーン 1126","duration":4.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1126スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そう…、でも僕は大丈夫だから、そんな顔しないで…、\n母さん…」僕はそう彼女に言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1126.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖顔２.png"},{"id":"43AE9864-7CB0-4ACC-A07F-3CE7D72E9D48","title":"シーン 1127","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1127スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「もし、何かあるんだったら、しっかりと人を頼りなさいね。」\n私は、そうこぼすと、病室を去っていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1127.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖顔２.png"},{"id":"76DEF5FF-0F06-4857-914F-A095B685D94B","title":"シーン 1128","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1128スライド","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、去っていった。僕は、つけたテレビを消すと、そのまま布団を被り、目を閉じるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1128.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256896_病室-昼.png"},{"id":"44794E96-E30C-4568-813D-D74893FA37C6","title":"それから時間がたち…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1129.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"2FD211FD-460E-49F6-9500-D1AE5EB0F33E","title":"シーン 1130","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1130スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふと目が覚めると、すでに日が沈んでいた。\nすると、病室の扉が開く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1130.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png"},{"id":"4131B182-310D-455C-AC83-6D2EDE11FC46","title":"シーン 1131","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1131スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢、大丈夫、暗い表情をして…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1131.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"AED3E16E-17A2-4829-9AD7-5A88D7D352D9","title":"シーン 1132","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1132スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「少しばかし、悪い夢を見ていただけですよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1132.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"B90E04E5-E03B-4079-82AC-D2A040539B43","title":"シーン 1133","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1133スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…、ほら、これ…」私はそう言うと、差し入れを渡す。\n「病院の許可はとってあるから、ちゃんと食べてね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1133.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"66250882-B012-40F2-8626-46C25DE301DA","title":"シーン 1134","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1134スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ありがとうございます…」僕はそう言われ、渡されたお弁当の堤を開けて、中身を取り出す。それは手作りのお弁当だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1134.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/困り顔小口開け.png"},{"id":"2E5577A7-3D5B-4830-A8A8-B3503905F6B5","title":"シーン 1135","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1135スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「これ、私が頑張って作ったから、しっかり食べ切ってね…」\n私は、そう言うと、一度、病室から離れていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1135.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/疲れた顔.png"},{"id":"CD36DDC6-0EF1-45CD-B98F-798DF978F258","title":"シーン 1136","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1136スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が病室を出ると、早速そのお弁当を開ける。\nそして、そのお弁当をよく味わって食べていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1136.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png"},{"id":"8DF46F4F-6ED8-4D03-9483-9B6FAA7C8C75","title":"シーン 1137","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1137スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、お弁当を数十分かけて、食べ終えると、僕は、そのまま窓の外に視線を向ける。そして、昨日のことを考える。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1137.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png"},{"id":"FE828EFD-D720-47E5-B954-80C7C5FE93F2","title":"シーン 1138","duration":3.6,"slideTitle":"第1138スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、だんだんと瞼が落ちそうになる。\nだが、ある光景が僕の脳裏を横切る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1138.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png"},{"id":"F8AFCF25-74F5-4146-8F4D-4DE4C9139205","title":"シーン 1139","duration":1.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"image56.pxd","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1139.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image56.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/フラン（狂気）.pxd","animationDuration":1.0},{"id":"875BC5A1-0360-468F-A938-7783D0C4EEE0","title":"シーン 1140","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1140スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢、大丈夫？顔が青ざめてるよ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1140.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/疲れた顔.png"},{"id":"FE22B2A4-993A-41C1-BBE6-50B99F538F06","title":"シーン 1141","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1141スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"僕は、彼女の声掛けで我に帰る。「あっ…お弁当美味しかったです…」僕は、自分の思考を悟られないように、そう誤魔化す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1141.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/疲れた顔.png"},{"id":"BB6BBA45-5636-4D61-A3EA-952DF9E672E8","title":"シーン 1142","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1142スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「本当に、大丈夫なの？何か、あるなら私に相談してね…」\n私は、彼にそう言うと、病室を去り、家に帰っていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1142.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/疲れた顔.png"},{"id":"67E5F25C-DB00-45E6-8C3D-17BBD7F8569A","title":"シーン 1143","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1143スライド","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が病室を出ると、一人考える。「過去を克服しないと…」僕は、ある一種の不安を感じながら、そう呟いた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1143.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png"},{"id":"BAC872E1-8F61-4791-96E4-C1B22A97D7A2","title":"翌朝…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1144.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"FCB85695-2075-4973-BBDA-82C16BA2B774","title":"シーン 1145","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1145スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、朝がやってくると、病室で朝食をとり、そのまま教室に入った。そして、席に着き、身の回りを整える。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1145.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff"},{"id":"D920626A-AD7E-4A6C-970E-13BBFD13F87E","title":"シーン 1146","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1146スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、教室の扉が開き、彼女が僕の席にやってくる。\n「あの、どうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1146.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/咲夜（困る）.png"},{"id":"092BE6FB-D705-4637-A3B7-6D9E775161D8","title":"シーン 1147","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1147スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「ついさっき、あなたのお弁当が届けられたので…」\n私はそう言いながら、受け取った弁当を置く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1147.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/咲夜（困る）.png"},{"id":"3D5B9035-F44D-4CE7-BB3D-A4E2936DC27C","title":"シーン 1148","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1148スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「これは、昼食用だそうです。それでは、私は失礼します…」\n私はそういいながら、彼の教室から去っていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1148.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/咲夜（困る）.png"},{"id":"C8FAD8D8-B6E5-4A8B-9394-F4950B819C9A","title":"シーン 1149","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1149スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、届けられた弁当が入った包みを開く。すると、弁当箱と共に、メモ書きが載せてあった。『何かあったら言ってね…』","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1149.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff"},{"id":"9169B3B2-7CB8-45AA-9302-5BFADC3182F2","title":"シーン 1150","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1150スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そのメモ書きを適当にバックに入れると、弁当を包みにくるみ、そのままバックにそっと入れる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1150.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff"},{"id":"86C2C534-4DA1-460E-A5C2-8F0232FB8E9B","title":"シーン 1151","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1151スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それからしばらくすると、チャイムが鳴り、担任が入ってくる。\nそれからいつも通りの、日常がやってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1151.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff"},{"id":"C3DE4041-94D9-45BB-A8F1-8B08669FA466","title":"それから、数日の時間が流れ…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1152.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"BD95D38E-12E8-4AE5-9601-326AB715C77A","title":"シーン 1153","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1153スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、数日が経ち、僕たちは、遠足当日を迎えた。\nそして、駅を出ると、さとりとこいしの二人が話しかけてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1153.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg"},{"id":"E2D0120E-1935-42E3-AF05-DDC0A786396A","title":"シーン 1154","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1154スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「思っていたよりも、人がいますね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1154.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"BE3B5CE6-9D52-4EF7-9BF7-DB46C2FA2824","title":"シーン 1155","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1155スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私が考えていたよりも、お台場を選んだ人が多いみたい…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1155.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"DCA633F3-769C-4212-8020-FE9E921E0937","title":"シーン 1156","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1156スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「電車に乗っていてわかってるとは思いますが、新宿とかなら、この倍以上の人がいるから、それと比べたらすいてるわよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1156.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"DCA4EECF-F4C4-4AED-AED6-9316A4858896","title":"シーン 1157","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1157スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「確かに、アリスさんの言うとおり…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1157.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"3C13E9E6-CE29-427B-8F2B-C005CC173E99","title":"シーン 1158","duration":6.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1158スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、場の空気が気まずくなるのを感じ、流れを変えようと、3人に提案する。「とりあえず、ショッピングモールに行きませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1158.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"ED438199-4E71-4188-A094-755DE7A05E19","title":"シーン 1159","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1159スライド","backgroundName":"image57.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「とりあえず、その予定だったし、そうしましょ。」\nそれから、私たちは、ショッピングモールに向かって歩く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1159.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image57.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E62034B3-1160-45CD-9A1F-3A4E37800F34","title":"シーン 1160","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1160スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それから駅から数分程度歩き、ショッピングモールにやってきた。明日から大型連休だからか、そこそこ人がいた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1160.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg"},{"id":"B89981A3-153C-4CA0-8D81-5BFD7AC7C685","title":"シーン 1161","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1161スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、こいしが僕に話しかけてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1161.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"652DB2A1-0358-4BB2-A66C-C9124E87CDD7","title":"シーン 1162","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1162スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それで、これからどうする？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1162.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"EFA17748-887E-4F0E-8680-582D39D38259","title":"シーン 1163","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1163スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう彼女に聞かれ、考える。すると、アリスが話し出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1163.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"9380A867-D3B6-4499-B84E-252419F1663D","title":"シーン 1164","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1164スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は、本屋に行きたいわ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1164.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3ABE2D3B-905B-4D1B-B6AA-9D064A3111F4","title":"シーン 1165","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1165スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「こいし、さっきからどうしたの？」\n私は、こいしがそっぽを向いていたので、そう声をかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1165.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"B4DB86E4-2C0B-4B91-B3F3-21D74907175C","title":"シーン 1166","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1166スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「えっ？」私は、彼女にそう声をかけられ、驚く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1166.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（驚く）.png"},{"id":"236D9AB0-6BF3-434C-909D-6BD02780A2AC","title":"シーン 1167","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1167スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「班長がこう言うのあれかもだけど…、本屋を見にいってても大丈夫かしら…」私は、そう彼に、尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1167.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5A4FBD15-043D-4B5C-99F2-3798A933CCEC","title":"シーン 1168","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1168スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう聞かれ、ふと二人の方を見る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1168.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"D4F9C092-FFB5-468E-9E2C-70A72AF8C857","title":"シーン 1169","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1169スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そこには、なぜか、頬照りながら困るこいしと、ため息をつくさとりの姿があった。「二人とも、どうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1169.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"648BFAC7-09DC-485D-A351-30C51244960B","title":"シーン 1170","duration":4.2,"slideTitle":"第1170スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、互いに何も言わず、気まずい空気になってしまう。\n僕は仕方なく、アリスの方を向く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1170.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"5D97C504-BCB8-42CA-AB56-36D45D8BC7A0","title":"シーン 1171","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1171スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いいですよ。ただ、昼食は一緒に取りませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1171.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"8FFF66B5-EB91-4BCB-ACF2-A641D5C643A7","title":"シーン 1172","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第1172スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「ええ、分かったわ…、それじゃあ、行ってくるわね…」\n私はそう言うと、本屋を見に行った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1172.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"62811AA3-648D-4094-86CB-53ED29799C4F","title":"シーン 1173","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1173スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、紅夢…。あれを見て…」\n私はそう言いながら、あるものを指差す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1173.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"3B545E90-1376-41C9-BD65-D3ED14F96607","title":"シーン 1174","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1174スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう言われ、そっちを向くと、洋服店があった。すると、とあるポスターが目に入る。僕は、そのポスターの文字を見る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1174.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg"},{"id":"5E05BD53-9F06-4272-9E81-EDE68C3FFDEE","title":"シーン 1175","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1175スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"その内容を要約すると、今現在、このお店で一定金額以上の利用をすると、金額に応じたくじ引きができるとあった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1175.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg"},{"id":"B4C52FC7-ED1D-4E00-83C7-CE78F71E8C9C","title":"シーン 1176","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1176スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、あたりの中に、旅行券が含まれていた。くじ引きは、今日までで、行き先は…僕が、見知っている場所だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1176.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg"},{"id":"EE35242A-C83A-4B34-A0CF-741FDC96F9F9","title":"シーン 1177","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1177スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、店内には、きっとその場所で使うことを想定されている洋服がずらりと並んでいた。そこまで見ると、視線を戻す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1177.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg"},{"id":"99BB4A67-B597-4D5B-8871-E41984028D0F","title":"シーン 1178","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1178スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「紅夢…、そのお店で洋服を見てきてもいい？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1178.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"573B1859-CA2D-4036-8D2A-884FAB025ABD","title":"シーン 1179","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1179スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ちなみに、そのお金は…？」\n僕は、二人が財布が手元にないを知った上で、そう聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1179.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"D6A2BBF3-0565-4698-AA37-7EEA24314578","title":"シーン 1180","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1180スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「えっと…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1180.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"8A2F7472-D5AB-49B7-9ABF-CAE97C13A7C2","title":"シーン 1181","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1181スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕の問いかけに、言い淀む彼女を見て、思わずため息が漏れる。\n「ATMを探しに向かうので、その間、服を見てていいですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1181.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"9EA45C06-7AD3-42DD-A426-19CACECB3998","title":"シーン 1182","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1182スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「えっ、こいし。本気でくじ引きをするの？紅夢さんも、\n無理にお金を出そうとしなくて、大丈夫ですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1182.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"279A93B0-EE1D-447D-AF91-FAB6A1660796","title":"シーン 1183","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1183スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ありがとう…！」\n私はそう言うと、早速、そのお店に入って行った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1183.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"D3010B9F-D9A0-4D9E-994E-AB6299E14078","title":"シーン 1184","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1184スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あの、いいんですか、妹のわがままに付き合っても…。\nもし、あれだったら、私が注意しますよ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1184.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"94F34F45-7324-47E4-84ED-3069587DC32F","title":"シーン 1185","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1185スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そういう彼女にあるものをバックから取り出し見せる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1185.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"D1E0B045-96AE-4A5F-BC53-FAD36D6A5B28","title":"シーン 1186","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1186スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"私は、彼がバックから取り出した、封筒の中身を見て驚く。\nそこには、ある衝撃の内容が書かれた手紙とカードがあった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1186.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"4FC2E748-030C-46B7-95EA-499905DC430A","title":"シーン 1187","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1187スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「そのカードって…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1187.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"0B3FE2DD-E865-41E1-8452-10BE3DD7EE17","title":"シーン 1188","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1188スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「デビットカードですよ…、こいしさんが、あのポスターを見なかったとしても、連休明けに同じ試験を受けるので…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1188.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"A200F88F-0A18-4963-B32D-60C0C3A7B36A","title":"シーン 1189","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1189スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そう言い、昨日のことを思い出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1189.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"D50D9243-D0D3-4AFD-8ABB-1207FFC107FC","title":"シーン 1190","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1190スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"昨日、学校から家に帰ってくると、僕は、入浴を済ませ、図書館で読書をしていた。すると、レミリアが封筒を手渡す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1190.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"27C970FA-2BE0-4281-8DA7-8F34C552B89B","title":"シーン 1191","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1191スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それを受け取ると宛名に僕の名前があり、差出人は学園長と記載されていた。そして、中を早速開ける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1191.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"DD59043D-1BD6-4308-A117-EC4E8D25BF35","title":"シーン 1192","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1192スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、そこには、遠足ノートに記載されていた遠足の後に受ける試験の内容が記載された紙と、デビットカードが入っていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1192.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"1DE99E9F-E083-4EFB-9701-E738464E9086","title":"シーン 1193","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1193スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、試験の内容をよく見ると、そこには、いくつかの試験が記載されていた、その一つに、外泊試験があった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1193.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"4F4AC8DB-9697-4D94-A3C5-CE6BDEFACBED","title":"シーン 1194","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1194スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"内容は、学校側で決めたメンバーで数日間の間、家以外の場所で1日を過ごし、与えられた課題をこなすと言うものだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1194.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"B2E1DFDE-CCD7-4317-A391-67395CEF8434","title":"シーン 1195","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1195スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、前の学校であった泊まりを含む行事の参加を、全て見送っていた。それを踏まえての試験だと記載されていた…。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1195.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"D842741E-755F-4D81-81B1-9FD2AB706F77","title":"シーン 1196","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1196スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「僕は、少しだけ安心しましたよ。こいしさんが、あのポスターを見たおかげで、既知の人と行動できるから…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1196.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"666C33E5-57FC-49CD-96F7-86FD2E2D8A16","title":"シーン 1197","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1197スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「そうですか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1197.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"D841F130-0FBD-4044-B5E4-D03E2C133AEF","title":"シーン 1198","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1198スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「とりあえず、ATMでお金を引き出してくるので、少しだけ待っていてください。その間に、買い物をしてもらっていいので…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1198.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"63602C95-010F-4C28-B507-FF27F616AF3C","title":"シーン 1199","duration":3.6,"slideTitle":"第1199スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「分かりました…」\n私はそう言うと、不安が残りながら、洋服を見るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1199.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"4AB0C11B-6D93-4F6A-97B8-CBF232C10469","title":"シーン 1200","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1200スライド","backgroundName":"nc270066_ATMコーナー（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、一人でATMにやってくると、封筒にあったデビットカードを機械に差し込む。すると、機械がカードの情報を読み込む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1200.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc270066_ATMコーナー（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"C39B05CB-3166-4646-9B9E-A3A59D3F2141","title":"シーン 1201","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1201スライド","backgroundName":"nc270066_ATMコーナー（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、封筒にあったメモ書きも出し、認証が済むと、東京の物価と服の値段を考えながら、おおよその金額を引き出した。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1201.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc270066_ATMコーナー（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"691D38D6-1C59-4192-B484-F63E4B9B44FF","title":"シーン 1202","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1202スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、ATMから戻って、洋服店に戻ると、こいしがある列の洋服を真剣そうな表情で眺めていた。「どうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1202.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg"},{"id":"0532A3E7-D638-4116-BA05-8C5D6B421B3A","title":"シーン 1203","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1203スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、これどっちがいいと思う？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1203.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/真剣な顔.png"},{"id":"C3855952-FBA0-4CAF-ACBE-744E3D268AD4","title":"シーン 1204","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1204スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっと…」僕は、いきなりそう言われ、戸惑ってしまう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1204.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/真剣な顔.png"},{"id":"F1E14987-F41A-43AC-8BC9-85653D9D427B","title":"シーン 1205","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1205スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、あることを思い出し、彼女の質問に答えを出す。\n「長く使えて、飽きない服を選ぶといいですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1205.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/真剣な顔.png"},{"id":"28C10075-51C9-4DB9-9378-6B1200CFA886","title":"シーン 1206","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1206スライド","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」私は、期待していた返答が得られずにため息が出る。\nそれから、私は一人で、買う服を決めるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1206.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"B8E77AD1-3085-4EB4-ADDD-B4E0D39F64CE","title":"シーン 1207","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1207スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから僕たちは、こいしが歩くのに少し疲れていたので、休憩スペースで休みをとっていた。すると、アリスがやってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1207.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg"},{"id":"37F6AEA1-82E6-4882-9187-FC70A84F7E5F","title":"シーン 1208","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1208スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「こんなところで、どうしたんですか…」\n私は、本を買い終えて、戻ってくると休んでいた3人に聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1208.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"619A2256-A66F-4A8C-9515-526933461332","title":"シーン 1209","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1209スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「少しだけ歩き疲れたので、休憩してたんです。あと…」\n僕はそう言い、見事にくじ引きで当たった旅行券を出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1209.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"AA4EC2E6-6A18-4CF0-8F63-01ECA0442BF4","title":"シーン 1210","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1210スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「これは…何ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1210.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3890F1A7-86D4-405D-9861-4746E67DDA2C","title":"シーン 1211","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1211スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんがいなくなった後、僕たちは洋服を買っていて、そのお店のくじ引きの景品でもらったんですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1211.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E426F7FB-F42D-4BE6-81EE-DA35DD2E9F92","title":"シーン 1212","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1212スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「チケットは4人分ありますが、どうします、アリスさんは行きますか？もし、行かないなら、誰かを別に誘いますけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1212.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FF076722-D60E-4F38-9A0A-1CA0DA2E7D5C","title":"シーン 1213","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1213スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"私は、彼が出した旅行券をよく見る。行き先は琉球郡沖縄本島とあり、そこで出発日が明日であることに気がつく。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1213.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"12C70358-2069-4070-9EC2-ECA39674267A","title":"シーン 1214","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1214スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「まさか、今日中に準備して、明日の朝イチに空港集合なんて、言いませんよね…、今日は、出発日前日ですけど…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1214.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"38E835C8-BC4C-4EA5-AA5B-729F08234DD4","title":"シーン 1215","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1215スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「飛行機の時間が朝6時台であることを考えると、今日は家に帰らずに、空港の近くで泊まったほうがいいと思いますよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1215.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FCBBAED9-C9C8-48CB-B94D-CA2B79E052CE","title":"シーン 1216","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1216スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「家には帰れないって言うことですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1216.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"59BD8498-74E8-496C-BD57-C0993AF0056F","title":"シーン 1217","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1217スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうなりますね…。それで、どうしますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1217.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"08E2E4D6-3448-447C-807A-A96AEEC7AE1C","title":"シーン 1218","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1218スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"私は、彼の急な誘いに、どう返すべきか迷う。\nそして、私が無言で、考えていると、彼がある発言をする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1218.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"A06B645F-CF14-41E4-9C2B-AB16EED6C21F","title":"シーン 1219","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1219スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは…、お酒は飲めますか…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1219.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"EB616961-5FF6-4452-A9B3-EF6CDAACF463","title":"シーン 1220","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1220スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「えっ？」私は、その発言に思わず、そう返してしまう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1220.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"3855F467-2F39-465F-AA24-780BC4F2394D","title":"シーン 1221","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1221スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、どう言う意図ですか…、その発言は…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1221.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E8A647CF-C6E8-4DE8-A60D-16310DF5FDA2","title":"シーン 1222","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1222スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「一緒に来てくれれば…琉球郡のご当地のお酒から、好きなのを言って貰えば、僕が買うので、好きなだけ飲めますよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1222.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"64CA8D87-1B31-407C-A906-AB0BF75DD550","title":"シーン 1223","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1223スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「えっ…」私は、彼が出した予想外の提案に驚く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1223.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"E343FBB6-9C49-4829-84AD-9C0999D0EAAD","title":"シーン 1224","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1224スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、いいんですか…、私だけ好きなお酒を飲んでも…、あなたたちはお酒がまだ飲めない年齢だけど…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1224.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"4A61DEEB-5AA2-4077-B4BA-624DD12FDCC4","title":"シーン 1225","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1225スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「ええもちろん…、それに高校生と中学生だけだと、何かと不自由なので…、ひとりばかし大人がいたほうがいいですよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1225.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"17E396A9-8AD9-44C5-B63D-F9D84826E496","title":"シーン 1226","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1226スライド","backgroundName":"image58.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「それじゃあ…」私は、そう言い、彼の提案を受け入れた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1226.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image58.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"8A0B54F0-041F-4418-B8BB-2A6D54CB65EB","title":"それから…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1227.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"DB5C1FA4-A3FC-49CC-A690-01D336555EC6","title":"シーン 1228","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1228スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕は諸々の手続きや、ホテル予約などを済ませ、3人はそれぞれ好きな軽食や今日の夕飯を買い出しを済ませた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1228.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"D5A186A1-6778-4E63-82E3-26A418697D70","title":"シーン 1229","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1229スライド","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「楽しみですか、旅行？」僕がそう聞くと、3人は頷く。\nそして、僕たちはそのまま今晩泊まるホテルに移動を始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1229.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"A1C353BD-483B-43D7-91F2-197F15ECE68B","title":"一方、学校では…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1230.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"FCF14BED-46FB-4A36-A06D-CB4D7AD9AD03","title":"シーン 1231","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1231スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、一人、学園長室で作業をしていると、戸がノックされる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1231.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"992CE9D3-1843-4ADD-80A9-44358E88219A","title":"シーン 1232","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1232スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"すると、ある人物の声がする。「入っていいぞ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1232.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"DFC11C3A-81E3-4ADF-8A4C-20E13684B0ED","title":"シーン 1233","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1233スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「美鈴か、どうした、何かあったのか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1233.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"171384B8-2E70-42B8-99A8-80029285EE1C","title":"シーン 1234","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1234スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「学園長…、つい先ほど、先日例の彼が居候している家に、送ったカードから数時間のうちに5回ほどの入出金がありまして…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1234.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"0F80929C-F5D5-4436-8BE4-E6EF2A0B356F","title":"シーン 1235","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1235スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「入出金の明細は、どうなってんだ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1235.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"57737844-1E10-49FE-AD5C-197EA8A341FD","title":"シーン 1236","duration":6.0,"slideTitle":"第1236スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「お台場のショッピングモール内の洋服店から1件、現金の引き出しと、振り込みがそれぞれ1件、ホテル関連のものが数件です。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1236.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"F57A43D4-1E00-4D4D-B743-A8534384038E","title":"シーン 1237","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1237スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「ホテル？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1237.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"4F404FDC-E896-4DDF-8D98-690D6985BFA2","title":"シーン 1238","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1238スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「ええ、一つは立体蒲田駅近くのホテル、残りは琉球郡内の沖縄本島にあるホテルの予約になっています。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1238.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"BA9FEDEA-9034-4BFA-9B3C-2DE14EAAF764","title":"シーン 1239","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1239スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「デビットカードを使ったのは誰かわかるか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1239.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"2E52D8A1-D385-4C67-9553-64387FA9EBC4","title":"シーン 1240","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1240スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「おそらく、例の彼本人かと…、どうしましょう、例の彼がいる班の班長に、何があったのかを聞き出しますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1240.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"FF570EEB-F071-4B80-9B86-0EA882BA129B","title":"シーン 1241","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1241スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「確か、あの班の班長は、パチュリーが使っている研究室で学んでいる大学院生だったよな…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1241.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"37C4DB83-C6C8-4890-B8AB-FB1D7ACA7592","title":"シーン 1242","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1242スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「ええ、班長の名前はアリス・マーガトロイドですが…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1242.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"5345AEA8-CBE3-441D-9FAA-0C1C9BD17893","title":"シーン 1243","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1243スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「なら、パチュリーに言いつけて、確認させて、あなたがその内容を聞いて、私に報告しなさい、期限は今日の午後3時までだ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1243.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"1E5919A0-F0F0-415F-993E-627E3A69CA19","title":"シーン 1244","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1244スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「承知しました…聞き出してきます。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1244.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"4C6AE3E0-855F-4992-B4B2-E825725A3582","title":"シーン 1245","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1245スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、彼女が去ると、手元の机からある書類を取り出す。それには、例の彼が遠足後に受ける、試験の詳細が記されていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1245.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"59DBEED6-52B8-456B-827C-666C885DC66B","title":"それから、彼らは…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1246.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"E5C9EBCC-B04E-4CA0-8F09-AE5A29A6F9F5","title":"シーン 1247","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1247スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕たちは、ホテルに着くと、予約した四人部屋に入る。そして、入浴の順番を決めて、アリスが先に浴室に入る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1247.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg"},{"id":"7FB63EEE-7BB4-498B-97A7-5BE7442259FA","title":"シーン 1248","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1248スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あの…女子3人と一緒の部屋で寝泊まりで…いいんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1248.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"64D51561-C760-4F7E-B0DC-5ECEB970605F","title":"シーン 1249","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1249スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、条件に見合った部屋が、ここしかなかったので…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1249.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"AC63F072-0663-4B45-9802-89AAFB7C5DF1","title":"シーン 1250","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1250スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「そうですか…。それならいいんですけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1250.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"B51AB78D-CC6C-4B5D-B790-B863453A115C","title":"シーン 1251","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1251スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それより、アリスさんの入力が終わったら、こいしさんを目覚めさせてください…」僕は、そう言いながら、こいしを見る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1251.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"3D5DEBB5-B057-43B3-A28F-867DE92099DE","title":"シーン 1252","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1252スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そこには、寝落ち寸前のような表情で、こくこくと頭が動いているこいしの姿があった。「今寝ちゃうと、夜眠れませんから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1252.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/寝落ち寸前.png"},{"id":"72709FBD-A304-4865-BF45-8C33ECB80440","title":"シーン 1253","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1253スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「分かりました…」私と彼がそう話していると、浴室の扉が開く。そして、妹を起こし、入浴に向かわせた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1253.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"C4503EB3-291F-49CC-A8A6-BE974834AAD3","title":"シーン 1254","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1254スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"私は、入浴が終わると、ポケベルに着信があったことに気がつく。そして、さとりと彼の了承を得ると電話に出る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1254.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FCB8AA4B-EFED-4BA3-B36C-B59AA81543CD","title":"シーン 1255","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1255スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「もしもし、どうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1255.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"D578F404-A357-4CC2-8AB8-9B53F58CA0D7","title":"シーン 1256","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1256スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「あんたたち一体、遠足で何をしてるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1256.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"7FC74C50-4A77-4C86-B7BA-AB0A2C156196","title":"シーン 1257","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1257スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「えっ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1257.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CFDC0EC4-D8B2-4813-ADDC-C283CB234D8E","title":"シーン 1258","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1258スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が困惑しているのを見て、目線で電話口を変わったほうがいいか、確認する。すると、彼女はポケベルを僕に渡す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1258.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"DCFBBC57-822C-4FA2-99EB-51891EDFF94F","title":"シーン 1259","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1259スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「もしもし、紅夢です…、どうしましたか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1259.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1ED16711-B645-4134-BF10-D41CD77B0FB8","title":"シーン 1260","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1260スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「美鈴から聞いたわよ、あんたが居候している家に送ったデビットカードから、短時間で5件の入出金があったみたいじゃない。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1260.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"A9E414D3-20D7-4986-B3AD-3FBF1D714213","title":"シーン 1261","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1261スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「それで、あんたたちは、これからどうするのよ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1261.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6C5046A2-B43B-4C47-B167-20EE178034B7","title":"シーン 1262","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1262スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「あれ…パチュリーさんは、知らないんですか…、例のデビットカードが送られたとき、一緒に手紙が入っていたことを…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1262.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"0F1269B5-15AF-44E5-9EFB-F63CAB51C569","title":"シーン 1263","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1263スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「えっ？何よ手紙って…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1263.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"BF2C19A6-4275-483F-97C3-8193DE885F59","title":"シーン 1264","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1264スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そう彼女に聞かれ、デビットカードともに入っていた手紙というか、遠足後の試験に関する詳細を彼女に伝える。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1264.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1B6F4F05-1D38-4509-BB00-B368ABF62563","title":"シーン 1265","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1265スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「それで、それは誰が今持ってるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1265.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"144F9B4E-A631-4B3C-9490-96DD345324D7","title":"シーン 1266","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1266スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「僕のバックの中に入ってますよ。それに、その封筒の差出人は、学園長の名義で、ちょうど都合もいいので…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1266.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1043E914-6CCF-4433-8BAF-F9DE05AAF0AE","title":"シーン 1267","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1267スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","telop":"「分かったわ、だけど覚悟してね…、お金は大事に使うのよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1267.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"03885D5A-DE66-4826-89E8-12D70920C080","title":"シーン 1268","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1268スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女は、そう言うと、電話を切った。「終わりましたよ…、\nきっとこれで、説教電話はこないと…思います…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1268.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5532D51A-B7E0-4A23-9F2A-7A2DF7B9389C","title":"シーン 1269","duration":3.8000000000000003,"slideTitle":"第1269スライド","backgroundName":"76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あっ…ありがとう…」\n私は、そう辿々しく言うと、彼からポケベルを受け取った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1269.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/76A7C805-E348-58FD-AF88-6D354533D371.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"A37D159A-F53D-4BEF-9956-A2207D1FA6DD","title":"一方、学校では…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1270.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"50F28D6E-B15E-4E7E-B78B-CF601A408712","title":"シーン 1271","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1271スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"美鈴が部屋を去った後、私がしばらくその書類を眺めていると、ふと彼の考えが伝わってくる。「なるほど、そう言うことか。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1271.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"218A8D5C-2BFD-49B8-A018-0993014FB067","title":"シーン 1272","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1272スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"すると、再び部屋の扉がノックされる。\n「いいぞ、入ってきなさい。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1272.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"27AA7F14-EAC3-477D-BE38-A6B12D01A54C","title":"シーン 1273","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1273スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「学園長…、その手元の書類の控えとデビットカードを送ったのは、あなたって本当なのですか？総理大臣からの認可は？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1273.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"FF678DB7-7110-4CC1-8CF9-E83AD76D79A3","title":"シーン 1274","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1274スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「えっと、それはだな…」私は、彼女の指摘に言葉が詰まる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1274.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ光なし目慌てる.png"},{"id":"76604C90-7C92-4DA2-AB42-B9A63E4AACEA","title":"シーン 1275","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1275スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「まさか…、認可も取らずに、独断で実行されたんですか…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1275.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"B9319C2E-B51F-4B77-938C-4E13DEED4A22","title":"シーン 1276","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1276スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「うぐっ。」私は、彼女の言う通りで何も言えなくなる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1276.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ光なし目慌てる.png"},{"id":"5019F2B6-F1A5-47A3-9DF2-8EC9DB101B6F","title":"シーン 1277","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1277スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「万が一の時には学園長の責任ですからね…、まったく…。ここ最近の学園長は彼に、固執しすぎじゃないですか…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1277.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/目閉じ困る.png"},{"id":"A79537B4-3307-42A0-8880-3847E5810672","title":"シーン 1278","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1278スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「確かに、お前の言うとおりかも知れないな…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1278.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ弱る.png"},{"id":"651BF0C2-A0A4-4C02-BAA2-6F43D255F49E","title":"シーン 1279","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1279スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「だが、彼に固執するのには、理由があるんだよ、美鈴。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1279.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ決心.png"},{"id":"F19B8438-904B-40EF-B311-BB598E6DC4A1","title":"シーン 1280","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1280スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「いったい、どんな理由ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1280.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"CCB3E1F2-0FF7-40BB-B174-3BDA4A786B42","title":"シーン 1281","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1281スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「その理由は、今度教えるから。この話は、ここでやめだ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1281.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ微笑.png"},{"id":"C1598622-C887-4C30-BFF3-A5BDD8F0040B","title":"シーン 1282","duration":3.7,"slideTitle":"第1282スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「そうですか…、それでは失礼します…。」\n私はそう言うと、部屋を出て行った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1282.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/美鈴（困る）.png"},{"id":"56060DF3-7A05-4C47-BAC2-44853F240B7C","title":"シーン 1283","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1283スライド","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、蒲田のホテルで一泊をすると、そのまま空港に向かい、さとりとこいし、僕とアリスで別れて２ペアで並んで座る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1283.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg"},{"id":"054EEB09-3058-4554-960C-D2D556E463D6","title":"シーン 1284","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1284スライド","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そういえば、アリスさんは、飛行機に乗るのは初めてですか？」僕は、ふと気になったので、彼女にそう尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1284.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg"},{"id":"52120721-B62B-4B67-BC49-98418BDA202B","title":"シーン 1285","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1285スライド","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「いや、学校での修学旅行で何度か、乗ったわ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1285.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"7703927B-84BF-411E-B729-30335BA2AEF6","title":"シーン 1286","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1286スライド","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうなんですね…、僕は小学生くらいまでは、\n家族で何度か、飛行機に乗って沖縄に行ってましたが…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1286.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"C5F7E23A-F9A1-49AE-B4C6-93397E447E4B","title":"シーン 1287","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1287スライド","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、そんな会話をしていると、機内アナウンスで扉が閉まったことが知らされ、それから少しずつ飛行機は動き始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1287.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"65F9285D-3A62-4792-8E80-F1F72C49745C","title":"シーン 1288","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1288スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、沖縄につき、空港を出ると、すでに手配済みだったレンタカーに乗り込む。昨日のホテルで手続きは既に済ませた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1288.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"B96D0A77-3863-44F5-9669-CB188F5F54A9","title":"シーン 1289","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1289スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「それで、これからどこに向かうの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1289.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"B7910B10-B92B-4EF3-8E46-1F10ABD48585","title":"シーン 1290","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1290スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「今日と、帰る日の前日は、国際通り沿いのホテルなので、今日は南部中心ですが、アリスさんは希望はありますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1290.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"44C18392-2DFB-47D2-B314-86293FBE8087","title":"シーン 1291","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1291スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は…」私は彼の質問にどう返すべきか迷う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1291.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"856B364C-BD18-433C-84D3-13596D4E8D2F","title":"シーン 1292","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1292スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「出来れば、海中道路に行きたいわ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1292.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"BFAF3F09-7317-4B33-BFC4-0F4E504D1DEA","title":"シーン 1293","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1293スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、こいしさんとさとりさんはどうですか？」\n僕は後ろの方を向いて、二人に尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1293.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"B170C06B-2720-482D-A465-2337D9AF79B7","title":"シーン 1294","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1294スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、紅夢に任せるよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1294.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"EA662D29-4305-4BA6-B356-2A2880FF3825","title":"シーン 1295","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1295スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私も、妹と同じ意見です。何しろ、\n沖縄に来るのは初めてですから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1295.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"E8EC5F7F-C134-43FA-8EAD-905DCAC08265","title":"シーン 1296","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1296スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「そうですか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1296.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"C772F509-0201-4BC4-AEDB-5C2E17C8224E","title":"シーン 1297","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1297スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから僕は、前に向き直ると、\n海中道路までの道のりを、彼女に案内するのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1297.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"6AABDA95-F67A-42C3-87D7-C07320354A1B","title":"彼らが海中道路に着くと…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1298.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"43E73079-3F79-4D14-93E4-D5A1F20E2869","title":"シーン 1299","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1299スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが海中道路につくと、道路沿いの海岸線に沿った駐車場に車を止めて、海岸線から海を眺めていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1299.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"2E14CDE1-9361-4284-A31A-F57A3763630A","title":"シーン 1300","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1300スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「波の音を聞きながら、海をただ眺めるって…良いわね。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1300.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"BE997939-6D5E-42D3-ABA3-F1C0BDF185CC","title":"シーン 1301","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1301スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、確かにその通りですよ。地元の人たちは、海は遊ぶものじゃくなくて、眺めるものだって言ってますから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1301.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"C574BD7D-395A-4517-97F2-E4CFCED083A2","title":"シーン 1302","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1302スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、さとりとこいしの方を見る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1302.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"19CD13E2-54AB-4B58-9C76-3798346B6C43","title":"シーン 1303","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1303スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そこには、海水を互いに掛け合って、楽しんでいる二人がいた。\n「海入って遊ぶのは観光客だってよく言いますから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1303.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"33610C0A-519A-4944-BD47-316DCDCBBD64","title":"シーン 1304","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1304スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「確かに…その通りね…。」私は笑いながら、そういう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1304.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（笑い）.png"},{"id":"36E75075-8EA7-40D5-94BB-324851396576","title":"シーン 1305","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1305スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「それで、この後は、どうする？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1305.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"D08D2B77-C6D9-4743-B6DB-E7C6D0B6C1FD","title":"シーン 1306","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1306スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、もうお腹がすいてますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1306.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"7B9E18CA-66F8-486D-823A-00F3296D7EC9","title":"シーン 1307","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1307スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"私は、彼にそう聞かれ、少しばかし考えてからいう。\n「今食べちゃうと、お昼が食べられなくなるわね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1307.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"06C66658-B43D-4695-9CBA-F7B6AAD016C1","title":"シーン 1308","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1308スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「確かに、アリスさんのいう通りです。それで、どうします？\n海中道路を渡った先に、タコスのお店がありますが？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1308.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E66A503F-0AD4-46E1-82E5-AB77828A56CB","title":"シーン 1309","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1309スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「タコス…」私はそう呟きながら、考える。\n「1つくらいなら、お昼も問題なく食べられるかしら…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1309.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"54EB6C2B-06B4-4CF6-BDF2-1C31BA3FA927","title":"シーン 1310","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1310スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「昼食を一気に済ますのではなく、チビチビ済ますなら、問題ないですよ。ただ、お昼はステーキがいいと言うなら別ですが…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1310.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"866790C0-52F9-4E09-BEA0-2631EFC79860","title":"シーン 1311","duration":4.2,"slideTitle":"第1311スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの二人にも聞いてこなくちゃね…」\n私はそう言うと、二人の方に向かって歩こうとする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1311.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5553E84B-EE67-481E-ACAF-C20CE05FB05B","title":"シーン 1312","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1312スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が二人の方に向かおうとすると、手で静止する。だが、その際に、彼女はバランスを崩し、海の方に倒れ込む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1312.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"581B3B3F-7B8C-43F6-8DEB-FCFF26655FCD","title":"シーン 1313","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1313スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が海水に濡れさせないように、彼女を止めるように動く。すると、彼女が僕の腕に寄りかかるように倒れる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1313.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"EB6CAE21-9CC3-4BD1-AC84-0A3C127CC625","title":"シーン 1314","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1314スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、足の太ももあたりまで、海水に使った状態になり、その状態で彼女を抱き抱えていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1314.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"476C3824-CFAD-468F-9B90-F65C049F6606","title":"シーン 1315","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1315スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女は、今の状況を把握したのか、一気に頬が赤く染まる。\n僕は、そんな彼女に、こんな状況になったことを謝る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1315.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"D31342A1-4C15-4B91-BF03-A4EFAC1871CB","title":"シーン 1316","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1316スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして気がつくと、アリスは僕の腕で抱っこされ、さとりとこいしが困った表情でこちらを見つめ、気まずい空気が流れ出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1316.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"EC23F1AF-83F7-4271-9216-BD91F6B6CEB4","title":"シーン 1317","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1317スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちの間に、そんな空気感が数分間流れると、\n僕は、くしゃみをする。そして、体を震わせる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1317.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"8D1E5E95-1A87-48AB-B7E1-08D34681BEB7","title":"シーン 1318","duration":3.8000000000000003,"slideTitle":"第1318スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「とりあえず、車に戻りませんか？\nこのままだと、紅夢さんが風邪ひきそうですし」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1318.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"41688112-A89E-467F-9151-252C132B08F1","title":"シーン 1319","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1319スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そうだね…、私も車に戻る…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1319.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"0E9099F5-9ECD-4B3E-9C92-BF86049EC6A0","title":"シーン 1320","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1320スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、二人がそう言い、歩き出すと、彼女を抱えたまま、僕も歩こうとする。だがその瞬間に、大きな負荷が僕にかかる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1320.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"FCA89F58-BEE2-4B04-A24F-C616E042E4F2","title":"シーン 1321","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1321スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの、降ろしてもらえませんか、紅夢さん…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1321.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"9FA515CA-2DED-4BFB-8D2D-584435D9B8BD","title":"シーン 1322","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1322スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ？」僕は一瞬、彼女が何を言っているのかが分からなかったが、すぐに理解し、そっと階段の上に彼女を下ろす。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1322.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"4E116E3B-E31F-4EB1-8A0F-8DA202576705","title":"シーン 1323","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1323スライド","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は足早に車に戻って行った。「えっ…」\n僕は、そう呟いてから、再びくしゃみをすると、車に戻った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1323.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image59.jpeg"},{"id":"487A0B42-78B0-4DDE-BED0-2D8AF01667A0","title":"シーン 1324","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1324スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、車に戻ると、元々座っていた助手席に座り、シートベルトを締める。そして、彼女はそれから車のエンジンをつける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1324.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FEF12111-535E-4D80-9939-1C8F8E47DD20","title":"シーン 1325","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1325スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、海中道路を一度渡り切り、Uターンして戻る。\nその最中、彼女が、心配そうな声で、僕に話しかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1325.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5363C82E-C506-4FB8-BC18-2539FCDF3552","title":"シーン 1326","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1326スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、大丈夫？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1326.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"295317F1-3350-4FD2-9162-F1D3B6B7AADB","title":"シーン 1327","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1327スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「少しばかし、風邪を引いたかも…しれません。とりあえず、国際通りに行きませんか？そしたら、ちょうどお昼だし…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1327.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"B02E83DE-CCB0-4F78-8AA2-48BE64BA05C6","title":"シーン 1328","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1328スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「確かに、そうしましょうか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1328.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"97F83B55-A8FB-4A3E-A5D2-8C472E54482B","title":"シーン 1329","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1329スライド","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それから、国際通りに向かった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1329.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3F6757AF-B75A-4BFF-96B6-6B1957061EB5","title":"彼らが国際通りに着くと…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1330.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"7A439933-779C-42EC-B29E-948DF1C6B180","title":"シーン 1331","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1331スライド","backgroundName":"473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちはそれから、今日と帰る日の前日に泊まるホテルの駐車場に車を停めて、駐車場の中を歩いていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1331.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"020207C0-CB1A-4B35-8C2D-992313D992F0","title":"シーン 1332","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1332スライド","backgroundName":"_.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ホテルのフロントに来ると、旅行券のコピーと、身分証を見せる。すると、部屋のキーカードを受け取り、歩き出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1332.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/_.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"7FD014FB-0A37-4B5B-AD21-4F6B1EB5202F","title":"シーン 1333","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1333スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、部屋2つありますが、部屋割りはどうしますか？」\n僕は、そうさとり、こいし、アリスの3人に尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1333.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"C75A667F-516A-41A8-A9E4-1C0462AF45D1","title":"シーン 1334","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1334スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それってつまり、誰かしら一人は、紅夢さんと同じ部屋になるってことかしら？」私は、確認のためにそう彼に聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1334.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"9B41B089-DE15-445F-AEF4-BA4327A43B33","title":"シーン 1335","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1335スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、僕の希望はないので、三人で決めてもらえますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1335.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"8995C1EA-6523-4151-95DC-535FB6BA9EDC","title":"シーン 1336","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1336スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は、さとりさんとこいしさんが、\n一緒の部屋がいいなら、それで構わないけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1336.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"8CBB0901-86AF-487E-BBE6-6B35D6E5CEC6","title":"シーン 1337","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1337スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は、できるだけこいしと同じ部屋がいいわ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1337.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5253C79F-FC82-4671-9FA4-A7966FFF80B5","title":"シーン 1338","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1338スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、こいしさんは…、どうですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1338.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"9B8526B0-B325-42F0-A295-E3C59DAA6D91","title":"シーン 1339","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1339スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は…」私はそう言いかけて、言葉が止まる。\nそして、ふと彼とエンドレスランをした日のことを思い出す…。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1339.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"0795C662-0425-4583-B54B-66613DC1049C","title":"シーン 1340","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1340スライド","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"私たちが、走り始めてから、最初の校門を出て曲がるまでは、\n特に問題なく、比較的にスムーズに走れていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1340.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ペーストされた画像.tiff"},{"id":"8691A743-D435-48CE-8E8B-554B1FE37FB9","title":"シーン 1341","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1341スライド","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"だが、1kmあたりを過ぎると、だんだんと、彼と私のペースに翳りが見え始め、後方にいた美鈴先生がその問題を指摘する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1341.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"C4281C1B-DBF1-4B27-A1C6-B2321D55E58E","title":"シーン 1342","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1342スライド","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"そこまでは、単純に走って疲れて、歩いているだけ、だった。\nだが、歩き始めて少し経つと、彼が急に走り出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1342.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"3B72AD8F-D7B1-4FEC-B591-78B3C99B67ED","title":"シーン 1343","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1343スライド","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"私は、慌てて彼について行こうとすると、彼の手がぶつかる。\n私はあのときドキッとし、そして、口走り、そのまま走り出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1343.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"3368EF5A-93A8-4AA9-86AE-51A33DA1DBDB","title":"シーン 1344","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1344スライド","backgroundName":"nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"だが、さらに1kmがたつと、今度は足元にある石ころにこける。\nそして、次の瞬間には、彼に抱っこされていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1344.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"C2E996BF-3137-40DB-9072-4070CB3C94F7","title":"シーン 1345","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1345スライド","backgroundName":"nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"それからだろうか…、私は、今までの学校生活では全くと言っていいほど、感じなかった気持ちが心から湧き出していた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1345.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg"},{"id":"C86D7660-1767-42BD-ABBD-71BD342E0C40","title":"シーン 1346","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1346スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"私は、ふと意識が現実に戻ると、彼が困った表情で、私の名前を読んでいた。「私は…紅夢と…」私は、続けて言葉を放つ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1346.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困り顔.png"},{"id":"850845AB-9E30-4F31-800E-9416CA45CB35","title":"シーン 1347","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1347スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「こいし…、一体どんな変化があったのよ…」\n私は、妹が発した予想外なその言葉に、そう返す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1347.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"B85A473E-512B-4BDA-916B-A62460CC23A0","title":"シーン 1348","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1348スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、こいしの発言に驚きながらも、念の為に、他の二人に確認をとる。「それで、部屋割りはどうしますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1348.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"EB6978CC-647B-4080-B3ED-B2517BF302C3","title":"シーン 1349","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1349スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、もしこいしさんと紅夢さんが同じ部屋になるのなら、私との約束は、どうなるのかしら…。」私は、そう彼に聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1349.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"C08277F2-79B0-4D18-B3CC-2DA243D30FBB","title":"シーン 1350","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1350スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、アリスのその指摘で思い出す。「確かにそうですね…」\n僕は、そう言いながら、考える。だが、くしゃみが再び出る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1350.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"5DBA25E1-63D5-4B72-9F39-46E3B93F4046","title":"シーン 1351","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1351スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「今日の昼食は、各自で準備でも構いませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1351.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"A9879D12-8F0E-4646-A69C-E10674450ED4","title":"シーン 1352","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1352スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それで、構いませんよ。とりあえず、紅夢さんの、風邪を治すのが、先ですし…、ただこいしの発言にも…答えてくれますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1352.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"846D1CEF-54E4-4033-89E9-80E4B206A538","title":"シーン 1353","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1353スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「じゃあ、誰と寝るかは、夕食後に決めるとして、とりあえず今は、僕とこいしさん、さとりさんとアリスさんでいいですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1353.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"5FD88B2B-4470-4C58-95A9-09B47E55D79C","title":"シーン 1354","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1354スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「ええ、そうしましょうか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1354.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"51C54980-3259-4CF5-8E9B-7814E79E0F8A","title":"シーン 1355","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1355スライド","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕とこいし、アリスとさとりに分かれて部屋に入って行き、各自昼食をとり、それからは、休憩の時間になった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1355.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"812A07C8-033A-464A-9E8E-3DC539859071","title":"シーン 1356","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1356スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕とこいしが部屋に入ると、僕は、浴室に入り、湯船をため、\n浴室を出ると、こいしがもじもじとしていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1356.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"B09FF148-B2E4-4EC4-BC38-58C3EB9E06D2","title":"シーン 1357","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1357スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どうしたんですか、こいしさん…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1357.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"1066860E-0C6A-47BE-86F7-1053B2E8F89F","title":"シーン 1358","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1358スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「こいしって呼んで…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1358.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"0AF7F940-8C09-4855-AE91-CFE79EB96A31","title":"シーン 1359","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1359スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいし…、これでいいですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1359.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"324657FC-6E05-49B4-AD15-FC21640D6ED0","title":"シーン 1360","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1360スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「うん…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1360.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"105A6F9D-4793-44FD-A6FD-3D744BE61CEF","title":"シーン 1361","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第1361スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「分かりました…」ちょっと湯船の方見てきますね。\n僕はそう言うと、もう一度、浴室に入る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1361.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"CB2001F6-4E83-48AA-94CA-E057B3B29765","title":"シーン 1362","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1362スライド","backgroundName":"image62.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、浴槽には足がつかる程度のお湯が溜まっていた。\n僕は、そこから満タンになる時間を頭で算出したのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1362.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image62.jpeg"},{"id":"B64D44E7-F79D-4014-8C9C-C20E657DC715","title":"シーン 1363","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1363スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それから入浴で全身を温めて、出ると空腹がやってくる。\nそして、ふとこいしの方を見ると、彼女も同じようだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1363.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"8B30557C-7DEF-4587-8815-3A22AFF13BB8","title":"シーン 1364","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1364スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どうします、ご飯食べに行きますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1364.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（困る）.png"},{"id":"1049D112-142C-4649-B055-A7AF315981D2","title":"シーン 1365","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1365スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「出前ってできる？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1365.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"EC070EF9-6792-4259-A28D-178AC983569B","title":"シーン 1366","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1366スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、テレビをつける。そして、テレビに出てくるホテルの案内を見るが、デリバリーの文字はなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1366.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"1FBB3EA5-12A3-402F-97A5-41F8D828531D","title":"シーン 1367","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1367スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どっちかが、外にでて、買いに行くしかないですね…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1367.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"9E19D186-5ED5-4532-B43D-17A5F052ABBE","title":"シーン 1368","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1368スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1368.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"F1BAEF0C-4EA0-4A49-83D1-490052C5AECE","title":"シーン 1369","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1369スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「何か食べたいものはありますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1369.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"32574F0E-4C98-466A-8184-73CE034EDA04","title":"シーン 1370","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1370スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「いや…特に…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1370.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"A8B748AE-5216-4E49-A0AA-5D843D160F6B","title":"シーン 1371","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1371スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、それなら、\n僕が勝手に買ってきても、大丈夫ですか…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1371.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"18D65500-1F51-4330-A2B3-3612EC43B8C2","title":"シーン 1372","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1372スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それで、いいよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1372.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"D3815A4C-4A9C-4E9F-AED1-3F1B405F305B","title":"シーン 1373","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1373スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「分かりました。それじゃあ、買ってきますね。」\n僕はそう言うと、一度おろしたバックを背負い、部屋を出た。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1373.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"23094463-BD20-4D35-9121-DF5AFECB5C55","title":"彼が買い出しから戻ると…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1374.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"E4EF9ACB-1604-4E5F-8D94-441CF8B7BA62","title":"シーン 1375","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1375スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、買い出しから戻ると、バックから〇〇〇〇チュそばを取り出し、給湯ポットから、お湯を入れて、蓋をする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1375.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"8FE2AE32-57E3-4DD9-B9F8-E9E6B74099A2","title":"シーン 1376","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1376スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、数分程度待ち、容器の上に、箸を乗せて、そっともち、彼女に、手渡す。「熱いので気をつけてください。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1376.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"ABA4D96A-7CE8-4B8C-91CC-5FD655DE297E","title":"シーン 1377","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第1377スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ありがとう…、じゃあ、いただきます…。」\n私は、そう言って、冷ましながらそれを食べる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1377.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"6BFBD95A-2C58-4E23-B211-1A7B78C69166","title":"シーン 1378","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1378スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が食べ始めたのを見ると、バックから油みそが入ったポーク玉子おむすびと天ぷらを取り出して、食べる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1378.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"79A82C6B-DC6D-4077-9189-1122DECD82DD","title":"シーン 1379","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1379スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、昼食を済ますと、彼女に沖縄そばの感想を聞く。\n「どうでしたか、初めての沖縄そばは…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1379.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/照れ小口開け.png"},{"id":"6A16B46C-ABF9-4158-94B9-D3F59505624A","title":"シーン 1380","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1380スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「美味しかった…」私は、お腹が満たされると、眠たくなる。\nそして、私は無意識のうちに彼の服を手で引っ張る…。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1380.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/寝落ち寸前頬照り.png"},{"id":"38DE2A99-139A-4A57-B317-8EEA8A97F50A","title":"シーン 1381","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1381スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、僕の服を引っ張る彼女を見て、彼女をベッドに横たわらせると、自分自身も同じベッドの隣で横になる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1381.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/寝落ち寸前頬照り.png"},{"id":"9B8A7786-B631-48E7-ADF0-42DD6F2C91AC","title":"シーン 1382","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1382スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、頭をそっと優しく撫でていると、彼女は気持ちよさそうに、そのまま寝落ちした。すると、あくびが出てくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1382.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png"},{"id":"79CC4AC8-CD78-4902-AB2E-C7C429BEB9AF","title":"シーン 1383","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1383スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、彼女の頭を優しくトントンと手を当てながら、そのまま瞼が重たくなって行き、彼女のそばでそのまま眠るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1383.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png"},{"id":"DF8A08F6-9AB7-4670-ACE7-7DCED5DF8CC8","title":"彼の目が覚めると…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1384.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"92344D13-26FC-4266-8E97-DAA4DC7E9B53","title":"シーン 1385","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1385スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふと目が覚めると、部屋の時計を確認する。時計には、午後4時と表示されていた。「昼寝しすぎたな…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1385.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png"},{"id":"37C2E274-5A86-452B-8009-10CEB8D97E48","title":"シーン 1386","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1386スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、起きあがろうとすると、こいしが腕を回し、僕の体に抱きつき、その場に引き留める。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1386.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png"},{"id":"BB0020B9-41F7-448B-BA5D-0816F1CFBB0C","title":"シーン 1387","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1387スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、部屋のチャイムが鳴ると同時に、焦燥感に駆られる。\nだが、予備のカードーキーでドアが開き、誰かが入ってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1387.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png"},{"id":"E9F57676-7EF8-4A5A-8ED6-E856D81BAF80","title":"シーン 1388","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1388スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、入ってきたその女性…、さとりは、驚いた表情で、その場で固まってしまった…。そして僕は、何かを悟った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1388.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"DD902502-B6E0-480C-A58B-6C19160C69EE","title":"シーン 1389","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1389スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそれから、彼女に理不尽なお説教を数十分受けるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1389.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（怒る）.png"},{"id":"60A9994A-33D7-4557-ADF1-771C6629A553","title":"さとりの説教が終わり…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1390.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"75E8ACE6-FE77-4596-AC8C-97C8960A9522","title":"シーン 1391","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1391スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それからさとりによる説教という修羅場を乗り切ると、僕はようやくベッドから立ち上がり、弁明の時間になる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1391.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（怒る）.png"},{"id":"B6C3D3B7-65E6-46F1-8B01-F90CABF455D5","title":"シーン 1392","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1392スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、その最中に、こいしがある質問を僕にする…。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1392.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（怒る）.png"},{"id":"B095A668-D488-44A7-AE96-357FF74314D6","title":"シーン 1393","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1393スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ…、今晩も私と…寝てくれない…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1393.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（怒る）.png"},{"id":"737C8F87-782B-44CA-A920-00270D0D88D0","title":"シーン 1394","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1394スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「こいし、やめときなさい…、もし誰かに甘えたいなら私を…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1394.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"02ACA7E6-DA96-4745-8DC9-4B741FF8B4C4","title":"シーン 1395","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1395スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「でも私は…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1395.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"85A066C2-442A-4D55-8E84-01B2B5741543","title":"シーン 1396","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1396スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が発したその言葉にさとりとともに驚く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1396.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"30E9136A-A9D0-41DB-86AA-E6BF64BCD86C","title":"シーン 1397","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1397スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"私は、彼女が私よりも、彼を選んだことに、複雑な感情が湧き上がる。悔しい、嫉妬、欲望…私は感情の波に飲まれそうだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1397.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/嫉妬.png"},{"id":"7155342E-09F1-4F0C-8855-310470D2588A","title":"シーン 1398","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1398スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「とりあえず、一旦外に出て、国際通りを歩きましょ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1398.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"EB140418-A3A8-45DA-9FF2-0A33BCA8C14C","title":"シーン 1399","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1399スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですね…、ついでに夜のお店も探しますか…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1399.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"531B3BD2-10C5-4563-BFFD-397A182FEDC2","title":"シーン 1400","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1400スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「夜のお店？どういう意味ですか、それ？」\n私は、彼の発言に対して、そう思わずつぶやいてしまう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1400.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"7FC323FC-AE29-406C-843A-1EDB259CAB10","title":"シーン 1401","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1401スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「夜ご飯食べるお店じゃないの？」\n私は、そう彼に聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1401.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"83E728B2-2E8C-40DD-96B9-0254AA0B58A0","title":"シーン 1402","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1402スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうですよ。それじゃあ、行きますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1402.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"9F138AB4-31A4-4BFA-8433-359190609F73","title":"シーン 1403","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1403スライド","backgroundName":"image61.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それじゃあ、出かけますか…」\n私は、二人の反応に呆れ、そのまま外に出るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1403.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image61.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（困る）.png"},{"id":"DEE7194A-158C-491F-89F7-61542F824D4E","title":"それから…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1404.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"2342E621-2FC5-4A08-AAEE-6EEA1E3E32A0","title":"シーン 1405","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1405スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから僕たちは、国際通りを散策していると、夕日が差し込む時間帯になっていた。僕は、3人にどんなお店がいいか聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1405.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"D5002C5E-F519-49C9-94A6-315C455255FE","title":"シーン 1406","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1406スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、この通り沿いなら、どのお店がいいですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1406.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"FA4FA3CC-81BA-4A72-9728-2FA5E85115AB","title":"シーン 1407","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1407スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は…、今日はそんなに長居せず、ホテルに戻りたいわ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1407.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"A71F8A04-C33C-4FEA-AC1B-A26565055E77","title":"シーン 1408","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1408スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、さとりさんと、こいしは？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1408.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"7296EE2E-93A3-4E77-A62D-9E2DEC41C635","title":"シーン 1409","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1409スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、昼寝もとったし、長くなっても大丈夫だよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1409.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（微笑）.png"},{"id":"EBB2EE31-FE65-4A4C-B761-9EC610E1986B","title":"シーン 1410","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1410スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は…、紅夢さんとアリスさんに合わせます。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1410.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"414B7523-48CB-4E36-8ED3-C2BB7748BB94","title":"シーン 1411","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1411スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、なぜ、こいしさんだけ呼び捨て…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1411.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"DBF98AC3-9416-4BB9-808C-5D1C65AB0732","title":"シーン 1412","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1412スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それは、単純に彼女からお願いされたので…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1412.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"BFE8EF68-FED1-4B31-B56A-6A3F812B483D","title":"シーン 1413","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1413スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そうですか…」私は、仕方なく納得する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1413.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"00D9A28F-DF36-44ED-B666-443A281CC6E8","title":"シーン 1414","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1414スライド","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちがそう話していると、ある交差点を通りかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1414.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"916B4CB0-CEF0-4657-81B6-9466491D376A","title":"シーン 1415","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1415スライド","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、コンビニの上にあるお店に僕たちは入って行った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1415.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image63.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"E72D8272-A231-4B22-BEED-01FD13F2AD81","title":"シーン 1416","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1416スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、そのお店に入っていくと、そこはファミレスだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1416.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"AEFB40F7-F116-49BF-8BCC-8D6A506ED1F9","title":"シーン 1417","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1417スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、席に着くとメニューをテーブルに広げる。\nすると、一目散に、こいしがある料理に目をつける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1417.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"67903900-E1EE-4B7D-91A0-6A13FDBC5930","title":"シーン 1418","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1418スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、これが食べたいな。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1418.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"A5A6FAEA-DD91-4ECA-BF95-F2069D01CC9A","title":"シーン 1419","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1419スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言って、あるメニューを指差す。それは、アグー豚100%のハンバークにご飯とドリンクバーがついたセットだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1419.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"2F37D8CB-6BDF-42ED-88B2-BE91ED500C2A","title":"シーン 1420","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1420スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女のその反応に思わず、フッと笑いが漏れる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1420.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（笑い）.png"},{"id":"42FA80B1-BF41-4483-9CA2-360B0BADCB79","title":"シーン 1421","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1421スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"するとさとりとアリスの頬が頬照る。\n「二人とも、どうしました？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1421.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"9100BCD0-75C0-489D-A3F9-B55830468611","title":"シーン 1422","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1422スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「こいしの態度が一変した理由が、分かったわ…」\n私はそう言いながら、あの感情の波が少しだけ理解できた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1422.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"04C274D1-E5A2-47CB-8ABB-2C9E375470BA","title":"シーン 1423","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1423スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私も分かったわ…」私はさとり続けてそういう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1423.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（怒り）.png"},{"id":"1F9EF561-2DFC-4314-985B-021738F41005","title":"シーン 1424","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1424スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、何かをぶつぶついう二人を置いて、最初の注文をする。頼んだのは、ハンバークセットと鉄火丼定食だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1424.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（不満）.png"},{"id":"40E351C3-614A-4806-B64A-64F29E2CCF16","title":"シーン 1425","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1425スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕とこいしはそのまま、ドリンクバーに向った。\nすると、二人は後から気づき、慌てて注文をするのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1425.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg"},{"id":"76CB9220-AFAA-44F4-84D1-F15DBF9D130C","title":"シーン 1426","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1426スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、ファミレスに着くと、各自が食べたい料理を注文し、順に順に運ばれてきた料理を食べ進めていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1426.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg"},{"id":"2E881844-3350-44E6-9076-923F7D2775A7","title":"シーン 1427","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1427スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、料理を食べきったこいしが、あることを聞いてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1427.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"602E02C6-BE86-4423-9DAE-9DEB946D1535","title":"シーン 1428","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1428スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、これ頼んでもいい？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1428.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"0738CB2C-3FD4-47F7-A5EA-4729A37E4B9B","title":"シーン 1429","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1429スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女がそう言って、指さしたのは、あるお菓子だった。\n「いいですよ。それで、さとりさんたちはどうします？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1429.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"E9070387-B761-4096-ADBD-E97E1B035222","title":"シーン 1430","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1430スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう言い、二人の方を向くと、アリスが話す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1430.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"01A48C0B-443A-489A-B430-28590D508905","title":"シーン 1431","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1431スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は、いらないです。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1431.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E6C2185B-1F1E-4A4B-9756-3B0FC8886EFB","title":"シーン 1432","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1432スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私も、別にいいかな…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1432.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"C4E422AA-1681-4124-861D-490667C9DD74","title":"シーン 1433","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1433スライド","backgroundName":"nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか。」僕はそういうと、それを注文した。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1433.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc307609_レストラン2.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"EC261583-9012-40EA-B820-CF44DE925C1C","title":"シーン 1434","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1434スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、夕食を終えると、ホテルに戻ってきた。\nそして、今晩はこいしと僕が同じ部屋で過ごすことになった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1434.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"B967B6FA-D739-4DF7-9939-9B6838C88399","title":"シーン 1435","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1435スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、とりあえず、互いに入浴を済ませることにし、\n今は、こいしが先に入っているところだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1435.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"2F137ECB-4810-4184-86DF-66EF36E60AAB","title":"シーン 1436","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1436スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、暇つぶしにテレビをつける。だが、なんだかどの番組をつまらなく感じ、すぐに消すと、ベッドに腰掛けぼーっとする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1436.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"255608C5-FF42-4426-8803-CFA266DD1231","title":"シーン 1437","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1437スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、突如として部屋の電話が鳴り、受話器を取る。\n「もしもし…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1437.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"2699F740-EF4D-4E57-B547-1D1F3CF905C7","title":"シーン 1438","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1438スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、そう言うと、相手はこのホテルのロビーにいる従業員で、フランたちがいる屋敷から電話が来て、繋げるかを聞いてきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1438.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"385791A7-E8A3-432E-9AB8-0CF35AA5F99D","title":"シーン 1439","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1439スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、特に問題なく、了承すると通話相手が変わる。\nそして、聞こえてきたのは、フランの声だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1439.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"37219DEF-AC23-46F0-8CBF-B703776102D9","title":"シーン 1440","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1440スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「ねぇ、紅夢、今は何してるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1440.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"C589FA06-81E1-4BD2-84A6-E4DD277E63C1","title":"シーン 1441","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1441スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ…？」僕は、その問いに思わずそう返してしまう。\n「確か、昨日、留守電を残していったはずなんですけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1441.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"8B507154-D4AC-448B-B4EF-2FE999CE2FFA","title":"シーン 1442","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1442スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「えっ…、ちょっと待ってて。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1442.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"9E013CB1-0ACC-4D43-8A81-143365F846C3","title":"シーン 1443","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1443スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女がそう呟くと、保留音がなる。\nすると、浴室の扉が開く音がする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1443.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"C089A6D5-FCB0-43C2-AD1B-4FA2CA1E19A0","title":"シーン 1444","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1444スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、浴室から服を一切着ていない、裸の彼女が出てきた。\n「…」僕と彼女は、数秒間の無言の時間を過ごす。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1444.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/えっ」.png"},{"id":"46749937-7B3C-4E52-A4B5-88F1CF35027E","title":"シーン 1445","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1445スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ぎゃーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1445.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/やられ頬照り驚き.png"},{"id":"0092955A-10CB-4419-9198-07B9CD5A7A16","title":"シーン 1446","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1446スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、彼女の荷物から何かを取り出し、全力疾走で浴室に戻って行った。そして僕は、受話器を耳に充てる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1446.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"EA61BF86-DEDF-4328-9DD0-59B785ABBC63","title":"シーン 1447","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1447スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「ちょっと、聞こえるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1447.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"DA83B702-F064-4193-9B04-7E7CB7090E65","title":"シーン 1448","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1448スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、聞こえますよ。それで、どうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1448.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"B63F8F76-04D1-4591-8863-21ADC6C60728","title":"シーン 1449","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1449スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…、確かにお姉様と一緒に、確認したら留守電が入ってたけど…、次に同じようなことがあったら…お仕置きだからね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1449.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"F6E64F1B-CD18-49AA-863B-D0D5B637CBD8","title":"シーン 1450","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1450スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…。それで、なんで電話をかけたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1450.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"7449F0F8-4F84-40E2-B97F-7B39DDB34C9E","title":"シーン 1451","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1451スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「えっと…それは…、それよりそんなことより、さっき何かあったの、なんだか女性の声が入っていた気がするけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1451.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"2EB07B7A-F318-4E1A-B146-CCE7390DDD1C","title":"シーン 1452","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1452スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「今は、こいしさんが入浴を終えるの待ってるんですよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1452.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"3E53EC93-4378-48E1-A72D-4AD188C33D8A","title":"シーン 1453","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1453スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「えっ、今誰って言った？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1453.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"9F63AA8A-A342-4995-891C-9E52C4ED4CAB","title":"シーン 1454","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1454スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいし、古明地こいしさんですよ。それがどうしたんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1454.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"5D9F8111-E8FC-42BB-8CC2-A232716E2CF5","title":"シーン 1455","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1455スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「まさか…、彼女の裸なんて見てるわけじゃないよね…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1455.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"DC1DB3FD-F817-4C3B-9EB8-D1465E9F2326","title":"シーン 1456","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1456スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「さっき、こいしさんが素っ裸で、浴室から出てきて、\n数秒の間の後、全力疾走で浴室に戻ってましたよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1456.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"BC26CEF9-04D9-4380-939C-9C4DCC20D735","title":"シーン 1457","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1457スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「この…、バカ…！とにかく、電話切らずに待ってなさい！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1457.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"12B7F8B7-EE7F-444F-AF7E-9930D69F50F0","title":"シーン 1458","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1458スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ…」僕がそう呟くと再び保留音が流れる。「一体、どうしたって言うんだろう…」僕は、そう単純な疑問を抱く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1458.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg"},{"id":"DA5A3308-54C7-41C6-9FB1-9373704711AA","title":"シーン 1459","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1459スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「このバカ！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1459.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り説教.png"},{"id":"24FB56A4-30BA-4860-BC9F-EEBFBAB2DD36","title":"シーン 1460","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1460スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"いつの間にか、浴室から出てきた彼女は、そう叫ぶように言うと、僕の頬をビンタしてくる。「何か悪いことをしましたか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1460.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り説教.png"},{"id":"3DCB2EE3-175F-420D-9634-C7DEFB763C9C","title":"シーン 1461","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1461スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そんなの自分で考えなさい！それより、ほら受話器かして！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1461.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ頬照り不満.png"},{"id":"996BEE22-3D2B-4072-8561-93A7E452648E","title":"シーン 1462","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1462スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、強引に僕が持っている受話器を奪う。\n僕は、仕方なく、入浴の準備を済ませて、浴室に入った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1462.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ頬照り不満.png"},{"id":"9EFD1018-B4F6-428A-93D6-8F9DB0F03BCC","title":"彼が入浴を終えると…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1463.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"B34E6938-F1A1-4D9C-A9CC-74F3A1E3CDAA","title":"シーン 1464","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1464スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、入浴と着替えを済ませて、出てくると、彼女は、フランとの電話を終えたのか、こっちをじっと見てくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1464.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照りジト目あわわ.png"},{"id":"4171C79A-DF30-45CA-9DAE-2241E757C179","title":"シーン 1465","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1465スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、あなたがあの男子校からの転校生って、本当なの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1465.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"EFA8BDF4-219A-4F22-9FFD-7770D8AB4199","title":"シーン 1466","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1466スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうですけど…、それが何か…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1466.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"C5D30B1E-6AAB-45F8-91C2-1B96F7799E1A","title":"シーン 1467","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1467スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「なら、私の質問に答えなさい。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1467.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"D7048C61-2182-469F-B158-45E732065D2E","title":"シーン 1468","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1468スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、僕に関することをいろいろ聞いてきた。両親のことや、前の学校、そして最後にフランとの関係について。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1468.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"1A5A6E55-9ACF-4461-BE2A-4322A67C5257","title":"シーン 1469","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1469スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あなたのことが、よく分かったわ。とりあえず、向こうに折り返しの電話を、かけなさい。聞きたいことがまだあるから。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1469.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"6E9F7516-62FE-4EEA-9914-BA7DA4F1BD70","title":"シーン 1470","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1470スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、受話器を取ると、フランたちの家電にかけてもらい、その後彼女が、フランたちに長電話をしていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1470.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"477011C7-B3D8-4520-A945-2AC347C83148","title":"一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1471.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"97F87688-C678-42DE-A69F-BEA5C5180A40","title":"シーン 1472","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1472スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"私は、暇つぶしにテレビを見ていると、ある速報が流れる。\n私は、その速報を見ると、妹の部屋に向かう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1472.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"34914CDB-A2F1-4E3D-9427-9DF5A500DE12","title":"シーン 1473","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1473スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"私が、長電話を終えて、はぁーとため息をついていると、姉が私たちの部屋に入ってくる。「もう情報が出回ってるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1473.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"B42F3CA3-617B-4361-A428-1B552F269D98","title":"シーン 1474","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1474スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「ねぇ、こいし。テレビで流れている内容は本当なの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1474.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"A5C4BA1C-6F24-43D2-90F2-EF857F96905E","title":"シーン 1475","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1475スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええ、そうよ。本当は彼には関係ない、内部事情だったけど…、状況が打って変わって、彼も関係者になったの。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1475.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"BF893F70-7C7D-472B-933D-2930909B6275","title":"シーン 1476","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1476スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それって、どういうこと？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1476.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"644FB348-C640-491B-B370-1BAE99B5C605","title":"シーン 1477","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1477スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「彼が…、私の裸を見たのよ…」\n私は、羞恥心を堪えながら、姉にそう返す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1477.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"58DEDA53-A0AC-4CC0-8158-8244008671F8","title":"シーン 1478","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1478スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それ本当なの…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1478.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"69BA2D32-7253-4167-B743-A159A8DC5D04","title":"シーン 1479","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1479スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええそうよ…、しかも、確定ではないけど、彼には副人格があって、その人格のときに、某建設会社の嬢の許嫁になるって…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1479.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"05EF6BA9-CDB5-4A0D-AD44-141F322D6A7E","title":"シーン 1480","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1480スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「ねぇ、もっと詳しい話を聞かせてくれない…、これは私とあなたの将来と私たちのグループに関わる出来事だから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1480.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"93627109-9FB9-4D0F-8018-9BDF2F165282","title":"シーン 1481","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1481スライド","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええ。」私は、彼が私の裸を見るまでは…、ただ甘えたい時に甘えられていた…、だが今となっては、それは過去の話だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1481.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image60.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"B85940A8-7BEF-42BA-8858-890869CDE069","title":"一方彼は…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1482.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"4724FE0B-80DB-41B8-8F83-75FA2B1518A2","title":"シーン 1483","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1483スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が長電話をする中、なんとなく気まずくなり、\n部屋を出て、夜の国際通りを歩いていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1483.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg"},{"id":"EBC38E60-F96C-470C-9E08-87363DEC1CA8","title":"シーン 1484","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1484スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、しばらく歩いていると、ある予感がする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1484.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg"},{"id":"1047EC55-ADC9-4177-93A1-5B44A4592D7E","title":"シーン 1485","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1485スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、僕は国際通りから少し離れた屋台が立ち並ぶ場所に来た。そして、屋台の間の通路を歩き進んでいく。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1485.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg"},{"id":"C4A03FD7-875E-4737-AB5A-F47D28B482AB","title":"シーン 1486","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1486スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、見事にその予感は当たり、頬照り、困った様子で、生ビールとおつまみらしきものを嗜む彼女の姿があった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1486.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"8541713E-FA6F-4318-94FB-F37286C3DFFD","title":"シーン 1487","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1487スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は僕の存在に気がついたのか、驚いた表情をする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1487.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"0DC482E6-F529-4D3B-9743-1477C8FCC834","title":"シーン 1488","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1488スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どうしたの…、紅夢くん…、高校生が来る場所じゃないわよ、ここは…、何か困ったことでもあったの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1488.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"04E04532-5202-4B9D-A7FA-027200AF527F","title":"シーン 1489","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1489スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさん、その生ビールは何杯目ですか？」僕は、ジョッキグラスの半分ほど残っている、生ビールを見て言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1489.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"23301C1C-A394-4F4C-A1F4-CBAAB446A049","title":"シーン 1490","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1490スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そんなことは、どうだっていいのよ…、それより彼女たちはどうしたのよ…、ここにいないならホテルにいるのでしょ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1490.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"F3EF04ED-A4DC-4185-9F6C-0FFCCC4B9290","title":"シーン 1491","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1491スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、カウンター越しに、お店の人が驚いた様子で僕を見る。僕は、慌てて首を横に振り、あることを聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1491.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"72FBC660-845F-44E2-95D5-2A50647B4759","title":"シーン 1492","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1492スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「彼女が飲んでいるお酒は、今何杯目ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1492.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"78DA015D-ACD5-4D82-8130-D24952D29341","title":"シーン 1493","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1493スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう聞くと、その人は、ひっそりと指を立てる。\nその指は3本だった。僕は、それで価格に見当がつく。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1493.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"3E8AF9FC-2457-4124-A6FF-F1FC7B1943FA","title":"シーン 1494","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1494スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、部屋から背負ってきたバックから財布を取り出す。\n「代金は、3000円ですよね…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1494.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"84A78F95-906C-45E8-9B6F-53D18FD2414F","title":"シーン 1495","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第1495スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、その人は驚いた様子をするが、\nハッと気を取り直し、お金を受け取り、笑って見せた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1495.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"77D45882-2155-4691-A189-FD134A742FAE","title":"シーン 1496","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1496スライド","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ほら、帰りますよ…、アリスさん…。」僕は、そう言い彼女の手を取る。彼女は、特に手間取ることもなくそのまま歩き出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1496.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image67.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"75C620C0-1B88-4CCB-A978-0B5E1B992359","title":"シーン 1497","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1497スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そのまま彼女と手を繋いだ状態で、その通りを通る。\n僕は、ふと彼女が、せんべろに行った理由を尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1497.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"CA83B17A-E829-4E14-99B4-38B895C38CCD","title":"シーン 1498","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1498スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、なんで屋台村なんかに行ったんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1498.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"486DB05A-28D1-4BCB-AB58-19A2235DCC1C","title":"シーン 1499","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1499スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そんなの…、自分に素直になって、あなたに甘えるためじゃない…、このバカ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1499.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"93F3E99C-246B-42C2-80FA-F452BF651399","title":"シーン 1500","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1500スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ふっ…」僕は、彼女の小言にそう思わず、笑いが漏れる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1500.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"E00A1447-EACC-4876-B553-8E94A55223A0","title":"シーン 1501","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1501スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「なんで笑ってるのよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1501.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（怒り）.png"},{"id":"86A1055F-F2A7-4419-9C74-453DA92CBFA9","title":"シーン 1502","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1502スライド","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それは、内緒ですよ。」\n僕はそう言うと、二人でホテルに戻った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1502.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（怒り）.png"},{"id":"995F8EED-766C-488B-B7D6-AC9E41007613","title":"二人はホテルに戻ると…","duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1503.jpeg","animationDuration":1.5},{"id":"4CEDFEA9-B6FD-4861-B5AA-C391E242D818","title":"シーン 1504","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1504スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕は一度、こいしがいる部屋のチャイムを鳴らすが、姉妹で寝たいと二人が行ったため、その隣の部屋に来た。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1504.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"178F21A6-C3CB-4B60-9C67-992FC1A49D33","title":"シーン 1505","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1505スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、お風呂に入りますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1505.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"6EB9F7ED-60C0-4521-8172-F0F19F8011C6","title":"シーン 1506","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1506スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そうするけど、あなたはどうするの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1506.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"D3F4FA39-A0AF-4A9C-B1BA-65109243A1E7","title":"シーン 1507","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1507スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、明日からの行動計画でも練ってますよ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1507.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"3D619337-4EC3-4739-89B2-721B2F76F719","title":"シーン 1508","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1508スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そう…、それじゃあ入るわね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1508.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"F8A693A5-8973-4BFD-AE80-5D97B7005D89","title":"シーン 1509","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1509スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、風呂場に向かう。だが、床の段差につまづき、彼女は転けそうになる。僕は、彼女のそばに駆け寄る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1509.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"D7C80298-F563-4793-868C-0351F0E7D8A3","title":"シーン 1510","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1510スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「うっ…、酔いが回ってしまったのかしら…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1510.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"7B26DA18-3F26-4349-A1EE-A7F730A13C36","title":"シーン 1511","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1511スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「でも、本当に酔い潰れたら、もっとひどくなりますから、それに比べれば、まだ健全の範囲ですよ。」僕はそう、助言する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1511.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"ABCB5820-164B-4B33-B5B2-A8F947A47E4F","title":"シーン 1512","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1512スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ただ、浴室で怪我されても困るので、\nそこで少し座って待ってください。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1512.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"457A4019-AC40-41B7-AD03-8D9810BE61F3","title":"シーン 1513","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1513スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言うと、バックからあるものを2つ取り出す。それは、黒色のアイマスクだった。そして、それを一つ彼女につける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1513.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"2CCDAD9A-B0B6-41EC-B28D-7B996734F11D","title":"シーン 1514","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1514スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「ちょっと、何するのよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1514.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"0E866005-74AC-40CE-B818-80803F8EB82C","title":"シーン 1515","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1515スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こういう時のために、向こうで買ったんですよ。互いにアイマスクを被れば、僕が浴室の中でアリスさんの体を支えますから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1515.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"95590EAA-48B8-487B-8F3B-765ED36A90AC","title":"シーン 1516","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1516スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ただ、触覚だけはどうにもならないので、そこは我慢してください。何より怪我なく、お風呂に入れるのが一番ですから。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1516.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"EFDD9572-8252-4D8E-932A-054925CF6946","title":"シーン 1517","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1517スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、アイマスクを被る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1517.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"93E4F500-1A32-4FC9-8116-3BD026BDFE45","title":"シーン 1518","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1518スライド","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、暗闇の中、スッと息を吸い、神経を透き済ますと、触覚だけを頼り、彼女の服を脱がせ、自分自身も服を脱ぐ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1518.jpeg"},{"id":"19B187E0-EFCC-46BC-9B6F-1A95090D72BF","title":"シーン 1519","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1519スライド","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、彼女をそっと抱え上げると、浴室の段差に気をつけながら、中に入っていき、そのまま彼女の入浴を補助するのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1519.jpeg"},{"id":"933419BF-201D-4A62-BC66-BD5E74711146","title":"シーン 1520","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1520スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、アリスを入浴させると、彼女が一人で出られるといい、僕は、一人ベッドに座り、ぼんやりとしていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1520.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"3E898140-D0A0-48DF-926C-250AE773778E","title":"シーン 1521","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1521スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"ふと時計を見ると、夜の9時だった。そして、僕は背伸びをする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1521.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"A4EA0096-135C-4EB3-A115-B141E2B7468E","title":"シーン 1522","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1522スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、ぼんやりと過ごしていると、浴室から大きな物音がする。\n僕は、なんだか嫌な予感がし、扉越しに様子を尋ねる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1522.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"9DF3E0C4-4CDC-447E-B071-5343B743D0BB","title":"シーン 1523","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1523スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、返事は返ってこず、僕は一度外したアイマスクをつけ、\n扉を開けて中に、入ると、そこには気絶した彼女がいた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1523.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"8FF57599-1F20-4219-9A06-CEE7BF89FF26","title":"シーン 1524","duration":4.2,"slideTitle":"第1524スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、強めに彼女の頬を叩くと、彼女は意識を取り戻し、\nなんとかことなきを得るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1524.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg"},{"id":"08F04717-1DC1-44C1-A71B-AA7689BA8DE4","title":"シーン 1525","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1525スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの…、ごめんなさい…私ったら…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1525.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"651F9077-204D-4DB1-B7BC-C4A2020D6299","title":"シーン 1526","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1526スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「別にいいですよ…、酔った両親の相手を、少し前までは普通にしてたので…、僕は慣れてますから…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1526.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"A674F22E-2EE8-4695-91E0-228CDCADB628","title":"シーン 1527","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1527スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1527.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"2D16140D-7ED5-4A76-A267-71700AE66EC1","title":"シーン 1528","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1528スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「とりあえず、僕がこれから、入浴しますね。」\n僕はそう言うと、着替えを持って、浴室に入った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1528.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"1347CAFF-695C-40E3-8461-93547DD38311","title":"藤原紅夢（主人公）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1529.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"C137B005-B5DE-42C4-80DB-CB720EA1B49D","title":"シーン 1530","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1530スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、浴室から戻ってくると、アリスはすでに眠ってしまっているようだった。僕も、ふと大きなあくびが出る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1530.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り寝顔.pxd"},{"id":"D8BCDBDC-12E9-47EA-BE33-DA61A9A65DDE","title":"シーン 1531","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1531スライド","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそれから、電気を消し、カーテンを閉めて、\nベッド横の照明を切ると、そのまま眠りにつくのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1531.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image65.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り寝顔.pxd"},{"id":"91D9B990-BD30-465C-BA2A-5589AFD8DBDC","title":"アリス・マーガトロイド（大学院生）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1532.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り寝顔.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"F7E295BF-F797-4425-BE5E-0A03DAD93A27","title":"シーン 1533","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1533スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ふと目が覚めると、大きく背伸びをし、隣を見る。\nそして、彼女が寝ているのを発見すると、そっと起こす。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1533.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg"},{"id":"22425D46-3A9E-495F-9357-001D7956554D","title":"シーン 1534","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1534スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「んっ…、もう朝なの…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1534.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"61A1E6E0-8011-44F1-B895-B29532209E44","title":"シーン 1535","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1535スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうですよ。今日は、北上する日なので、ささっと準備を済ませたら、出発しますよ。途中で朝食も取るので。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1535.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"6D8F3E8D-6AA0-4374-94D3-F4B0CFCB02FC","title":"シーン 1536","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1536スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「北上するって、どこに向かうの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1536.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"08395F1C-16E2-4211-828F-74B06EE97EDB","title":"シーン 1537","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1537スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「恩納村です。高速は使わないので、お金は必要ないですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1537.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"44A8B694-7064-41ED-929D-3CBCC5E7F1FD","title":"シーン 1538","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1538スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1538.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FB423969-847D-4830-B43B-F35B677AC906","title":"シーン 1539","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1539スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、そんな話をしていると、玄関のチャイムが鳴る。\nすると、扉が開き、さとりとこいしが入ってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1539.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"D25C8F03-A401-4BF3-8DC7-D7F904DD00A7","title":"シーン 1540","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1540スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女はある書面を机上に置き、ペンを僕に渡し、サインをするように言ってくる。僕は、その書面の内容を読む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1540.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"77DE2C3E-88F1-4500-A503-89CEAC2F9B95","title":"シーン 1541","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1541スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それで、あなたはこの内容に同意してくれるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1541.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"F1B10D32-3AAF-48F8-B356-798C876EF394","title":"シーン 1542","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1542スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、その書面に記された文章を見る。書面の下には、彼女のサインと何かの印章が貼られていた。すると、彼女が急かす。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1542.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"27429A6E-FA2E-465B-983A-327C519B105D","title":"シーン 1543","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1543スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「まだ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1543.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"AFDE8B10-86B2-43D0-8097-23F8F5CF06E8","title":"シーン 1544","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1544スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「この内容…、フランさんたちは知ってるんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1544.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CB63836E-72ED-4E3F-BD62-5B445A4CACDB","title":"シーン 1545","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1545スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええ、彼女たちに宣戦布告したのよ。昨日も言ったけど、もう以前の関係には戻れない、これは…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1545.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"3C21DB73-F0E1-4488-B502-CD8834AB2DE8","title":"シーン 1546","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1546スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そこまで言うと、彼女は頬を赤らめ、数秒の間の後、言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1546.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"2416FD86-858B-4310-B0F2-D5F258A42C7E","title":"シーン 1547","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1547スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「これは…、あなたの結婚相手…いや、後継をめぐる紅魔建設と私たち…、地下底国グループが戦うための文書なのよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1547.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"E6DB94B1-8B53-47FF-A199-5DBE33F1E16B","title":"シーン 1548","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1548スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それに、学校側だって、あなたが欲しいから、きっとこの戦いに参戦してくるわ。あなたは、その戦いの主軸なのよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1548.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"A010E763-443B-4849-8D0D-2D8454FEE3D9","title":"シーン 1549","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1549スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「…」僕は、次々と述べられる彼女の言葉の意味をうまく受け取れずに、ただ困惑してしまう。そして、さとりに視線を向ける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1549.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"936171AE-79E8-4C10-B575-A8CC6ADB50B1","title":"シーン 1550","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1550スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「これは…、一体どう言うことですか…、さとりさん…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1550.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"9213193C-94C9-4D45-ACEB-F812E5AE7D2C","title":"シーン 1551","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1551スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あなたが、昨日、妹の裸を見たことで、私たちの中での決まりが、あなたにも適用されたんですよ、強制ではないですが…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1551.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CEFAEB12-0F7F-4989-A537-602410687C35","title":"シーン 1552","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1552スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あと、あなたの母親のところも、後継者の関係で、あなたを引き戻したいそうよ。だから、四つ巴の戦いなのよ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1552.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"0B88130B-FDA8-48B2-806B-73717BB913D5","title":"シーン 1553","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1553スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「簡単に言えば、私たちとあなたどう言う関係なのかを明白にし、戦いの混乱を避けるための同意が必要なんですよ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1553.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"B96CBEFE-B7FB-4774-A8C0-27E7D758C868","title":"シーン 1554","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1554スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、さとりの補足説明で、彼女たちが言いたいことを大まかに把握する。「別に構いませんけど…、一つだけいいですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1554.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"ABD10398-7CED-40EB-AAEA-DD8B70E8BF9C","title":"シーン 1555","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1555スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「どんな条件なの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1555.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（不満）.png"},{"id":"DE947799-4466-4223-8D8A-59AD8D989C13","title":"シーン 1556","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1556スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「向こうに帰るまでは、これまで通りで過ごしませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1556.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"F87CF701-2E7D-4697-830D-E6E11EEA121C","title":"シーン 1557","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1557スライド","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう言うと、二人は驚く。そして、二人の賛同を得た後、書面にサインを記して、恩納村へと向かうのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1557.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image68.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1BA56808-9DDC-48EC-A4D5-E894082F896B","title":"古明地こいし（中学生）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1558.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り説教.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"36322320-FB5A-40FF-A88C-AA27226ED143","title":"シーン 1559","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1559スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"私とお姉様は、昨日、こいしからの長電話を受けた後、夜通し、今後の事を話し合って行った。「それで、どうするの…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1559.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"6A5D298C-A606-4320-8E46-3F8B0A858012","title":"シーン 1560","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1560スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「なんで彼は、あんな巨大組織の令嬢の裸を見たのかしら…。\nたとえ、アクシデントでもあんなことを言うなんて…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1560.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"B5EE61D6-8538-4B58-A0FB-335FB65D665D","title":"シーン 1561","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1561スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とにかく、彼が旅行から戻ってきたら、厳しく言いつけて、戦いに勝って、私たちの方に、なんとしてでも引き込むわよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1561.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"2028B076-8F2F-467D-9A83-CE1A48A40356","title":"シーン 1562","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1562スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私だって、彼がいなくなるのは嫌だし、お姉様に協力する。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1562.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"385F1FED-FE4C-4BD8-9169-CC0AEEA231F5","title":"シーン 1563","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1563スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「いいこと思いついたわ、フラン。何かしらの口実をつけて、学校と彼の母親を裏切る前提で味方につけなさい。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1563.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/東方惑情録　第3話/レミリア（余裕）.png"},{"id":"1197EECA-99F2-4935-B4A6-D37752CB5178","title":"シーン 1564","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1564スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「えっ…、そんなことして大丈夫なの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1564.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/東方惑情録　第3話/レミリア（余裕）.png"},{"id":"C9C9258D-DDA9-4B6A-ADB1-FE79F3156716","title":"シーン 1565","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1565スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「いいのよ別に、これは女同士の泥沼試合なのだから。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1565.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/東方惑情録　第3話/レミリア（余裕）.png"},{"id":"AA7D1B13-1D0F-4B35-8E8D-31FF76560FFA","title":"シーン 1566","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1566スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…わかった。」\n私はそれから、お姉様の言うとおりに動くのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1566.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/東方惑情録　第3話/レミリア（余裕）.png"},{"id":"E148F2F6-AA81-45FB-8926-4776BE530B92","title":"フランドール・スカーレット（紅魔建設の破壊作業員）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"夜のお誘い.png","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1567.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/夜のお誘い.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"C0B520F8-235A-41A2-8BA1-1419B2DD0DED","title":"シーン 1568","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1568スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、ふとため息を学園長室でついていた。「はぁ…」\n理由は明白で、昨晩にあった、ある電話である。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1568.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"E4DD8E8C-D89E-4518-A7FD-3A62E1F9A04F","title":"シーン 1569","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1569スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私が、昨日、残業で職務をこなしていると、一本の電話が入る。\nそれを知らせにきた、萃香はいかにも面倒そうな顔をしていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1569.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（弱る）.png"},{"id":"42431869-DB96-4D71-9A74-BF859441AE4D","title":"シーン 1570","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1570スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、彼女の言葉を受けると、内線を繋ぎ、相手の声を聞く。\nその声は、中等部の女子生徒、古明地こいしの声だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1570.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（弱る）.png"},{"id":"5F9D43E5-4ECF-4561-A2C1-7BEA5F74F24F","title":"シーン 1571","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1571スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、電話越しに彼女が起こっていることを感じ、なぜ起こっているのかと聞く。すると例の彼が、彼女の裸を見たと言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1571.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（弱る）.png"},{"id":"3FFC86F1-5406-4048-A726-FA0BE0F7E9A8","title":"シーン 1572","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1572スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私と萃香は驚きながらも、相手の話を聞く。すると、彼女はある衝撃的な発言を言ってきた。私は、その内容に困惑する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1572.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"3B9687FB-274B-4619-BC2F-0DF9AEB281DC","title":"シーン 1573","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1573スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"だが、すぐに永琳からの電話も飛んできて、\n私はこいしの電話を保留にし、そちらに切り替える。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1573.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"D386679E-09AB-49DA-8EDD-71E26A0D331C","title":"シーン 1574","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1574スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"永琳が言うには、彼は貴重な研究対象だから、学園から話さずに、学校側の手が届く範囲でいさせたいとの要望だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1574.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"AD339984-20CC-4197-AB5A-C6C2E69455D2","title":"シーン 1575","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1575スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、彼が貴重な人物であることは認識していたが、それほど重要性の高い人物だとは、正直に言って感じてなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1575.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"00BD1349-AD9E-44B4-B5B7-5E8F07651652","title":"シーン 1576","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1576スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、一通り永琳の意見を聞き終えると、こいしの方に再度、切り替える。すると、彼女は、これは戦いだと、言ってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1576.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"C419D737-971E-4C3B-9B43-033A3B7BF2C8","title":"シーン 1577","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1577スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"そして、彼女は控えめだったが、もし彼女たちの要請に応じられないなら、学園の資金提供などの協力は打ち切ると言ってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1577.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"45C95C9F-16F9-4C06-AABE-29414AF2189D","title":"シーン 1578","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1578スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"どうやらすでに、彼女の両親がトップに鎮座する地下底国グループの意見を聞き取り、グループの見解になったそうだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1578.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"2C1F1413-CA13-4209-9DEC-81F905D580D7","title":"シーン 1579","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1579スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"地下底国グループは、その名の通り、この社会の土台や裏側を幅広く、汎用的に事業を展開し支える巨大組織である。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1579.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"F6104CBA-BFC3-4564-9ADD-A2F40A0B3592","title":"シーン 1580","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1580スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"彼女は、今までその名では行動することはなかった。\n学校生活とグループでの完全な使い分けをしていたのだ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1580.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"A8B62AE5-23F7-484B-97E1-135D87BC4E3A","title":"シーン 1581","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1581スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"そんな彼女の裸を運悪く見てしまった彼を発端に、彼女は今まであえて潜めていたグループを使い始めたことに、私は驚いた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1581.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"4F7CFA32-8D22-4A89-81DD-34441F2AF3A1","title":"シーン 1582","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1582スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"そして、彼女は、彼が居候している家が立ち上げている紅魔建設と、彼の母親にも宣戦布告を済ませたと言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1582.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"16EDA2DC-0311-43F1-8E95-CE7A3A5E479C","title":"シーン 1583","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1583スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"彼女は、自分の裸が見られた後、彼の素性を問いただし、彼がいなくなると、隠し持っていたPCで彼の母親を調べたという。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1583.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"D4351C5C-D34F-40C0-8341-3D5BB83D5EB5","title":"シーン 1584","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1584スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"そして、その結果、彼の母親が務める神社の跡取りとして、彼に期待されているのを知った彼女は、宣戦布告をしたのだ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1584.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"2FADE43C-4E08-44F8-AD97-C6DA82B4ACEF","title":"シーン 1585","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1585スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"そして、最後にはこの4つ巴の戦いは、旅行が終わったら、即時に始まると高圧的に宣言し、その電話は途切れたのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1585.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-10_17-38.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/萃香（驚く）.png"},{"id":"411DBA3F-B86F-47C5-BCAB-2C408C8457E7","title":"シーン 1586","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1586スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"私は、彼女が地下底国グループの令嬢であることは、把握していたつもりだったが、今回の出来事で、それを実感させられた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1586.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"D0BB9D77-51EA-40EE-A448-B812F5A7D387","title":"シーン 1587","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1587スライド","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"だが、これから始まるであろう、\nその戦いに不安を覚える、私だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1587.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg"},{"id":"E0F14401-D5B8-41D9-843B-60D142637DB1","title":"博麗霊夢（博麗神社の巫女）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1588.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/気持ちの良い寝顔.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"374AB9B8-68B5-4B6E-ADB7-ACF01A7FA556","title":"シーン 1589","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1589スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「はぁ」私は、ため息をつきながら、神社の敷地を箒で掃いていた。ため息が出る理由は、巨大組織の令嬢からの電話だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1589.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"id":"FB483518-C2E8-4F95-A52F-07D17617D2FB","title":"シーン 1590","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1590スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「ほら、ため息なんかついてないで、チャチャっとやったらどうなのよ、霊夢」私はそう、箒を持っている娘の霊夢に言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1590.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（怒る）.png"},{"id":"C98C7B25-BF9F-44D4-81E8-A227D8DAC245","title":"シーン 1591","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1591スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「はぁ、そんなことくらい分かってるわよ、言わずとも。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1591.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（怒る）.png"},{"id":"FAB808F8-45A9-4758-9C39-0829F6F017F1","title":"シーン 1592","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1592スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「そうなら、もっとやる気出して、テキパキ履きなさい。それで、例の跡取りになりそうな孫は、どうするのよ、今後？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1592.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（怒る）.png"},{"id":"CF7BE98C-DCD1-4919-B090-6BE6F0AE6BAB","title":"シーン 1593","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1593スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「それは…」私は、ここで素直に、宣戦布告の事情を伝えるかどうか迷う。だが、伝えた方がいいと判断し、話し始める。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1593.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（怒る）.png"},{"id":"0849825E-5541-48F9-8925-8B998AF78398","title":"シーン 1594","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1594スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「それなら、宣戦布告されたわよ、\n地下底国グループのご令嬢に。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1594.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（怒る）.png"},{"id":"E347B01E-DCE7-41D3-A68B-86ED963950F4","title":"シーン 1595","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1595スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「えっ？宣戦布告ってどう言うこと。だって彼は、あんたの息子だから、彼が何も言わない限り、ここで働くんじゃないの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1595.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（困る）.png"},{"id":"F36B4EC1-D5AF-479B-9F58-11286642212F","title":"シーン 1596","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1596スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「例のご令嬢の裸を、彼が見たって言ってたわよ…」\n私は、なんだか気恥ずかしさを感じながら、そう言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1596.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（困る）.png"},{"id":"4AF73AC8-B6E0-4BB8-951C-6BE27BADEFB1","title":"シーン 1597","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1597スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「えっ？どういうこと、ご令嬢の裸を見たって…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1597.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（困る）.png"},{"id":"6198183A-35BC-4F3B-99BF-8C6B38D04FC9","title":"シーン 1598","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1598スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「そのご令嬢と同じ部屋で過ごしていたら、ご令嬢が裸で出てきて、彼はその姿をしっかりと捉えて、ビンタを食らったって…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1598.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/靈夢（困る）.png"},{"id":"AB0DBDD9-5780-4D57-BEB5-27C20046E54C","title":"シーン 1599","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1599スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「ふーん、それであんたはどう思うのよ、\n自分の息子がご令嬢の裸を見たって言う事実に対して。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1599.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霊異変疑問.png"},{"id":"8FC7F6D2-3151-4095-9FB3-C20844AC6D91","title":"シーン 1600","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1600スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「どうって…」私はそう言われ、意見を言おうとするが、何を言えばいいかわからない。すると、彼女がある言葉を言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1600.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霊異変疑問.png"},{"id":"3F4DA826-9B3F-47AF-8CED-DE63AB3CC8E3","title":"シーン 1601","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1601スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「まさかとは思うけど、ヤキモチなんてしてないわよね…」\n私が、そう娘に問いただすと、娘は明らかに動揺する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1601.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霊異変疑問.png"},{"id":"2729C948-D897-42D8-A087-0B08F73AA838","title":"シーン 1602","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1602スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"先代の巫女","telop":"「これは、図星ね…、まぁ、いいわ。ほら、やる気出して、チャチャっと敷地内の埃を吐き出しなさい。いいわね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"先代の巫女","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1602.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霊異変疑問.png"},{"id":"32C338FB-C0B4-49AE-BA26-4AC802F774AC","title":"シーン 1603","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1603スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"私は、それから、頭を横に振って、掃き掃除を進めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1603.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"id":"CBFCA37B-0349-4AEE-8E54-764C295C9556","title":"シーン 1604","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1604スライド","backgroundName":"image69.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"あれから僕たちは、朝食を間にとって、恩納村にあるホテルにお昼前に着いた。そして、アリスが車を停めに向かう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1604.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image69.jpeg"},{"id":"84CBCACE-ED57-4049-9FD9-2E226DFB20C3","title":"シーン 1605","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1605スライド","backgroundName":"image70.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"アリスが車を停めに行っている間、僕はチェックインの手続きを済ます。そして、ロビーのソファで休んでいる二人の元に戻る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1605.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image70.jpeg"},{"id":"634B43E6-B092-4054-BE51-78CB2DBDF31B","title":"シーン 1606","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1606スライド","backgroundName":"image70.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が二人の元に来ると、ここまでの道中やホテルに対する感想を呟いていた。「お昼ご飯までは、休憩の時間にしますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1606.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image70.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"411F33A5-04D2-43C9-8BD8-B80E23B9874B","title":"シーン 1607","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1607スライド","backgroundName":"image70.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そうしようかな…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1607.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image70.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"B349CD3E-3032-43D1-B902-A4584CB68726","title":"シーン 1608","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1608スライド","backgroundName":"image70.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私も、こいしと同様に休憩の時間を取りたいです…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1608.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image70.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"6D238789-47B1-4A80-8D1D-B1F7648FE5E7","title":"シーン 1609","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1609スライド","backgroundName":"image70.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「分かりました…」僕たちがそう話していると、アリスがやってくる。それから、僕たちは、今日から泊まる4人部屋に移動した。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1609.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image70.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/困った笑み小口笑い.png"},{"id":"5BD494B9-C9FA-4BF3-AE43-9FE5FAD1F60F","title":"シーン 1610","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1610スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちがそれから、泊まる部屋にやってくると、その部屋は和洋折衷の4人部屋だった。すると、後ろから驚きの声がする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1610.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg"},{"id":"C7AD56B4-5E5E-48DD-AAA7-09FE6345135C","title":"シーン 1611","duration":6.0,"slideTitle":"第1611スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ここは、4人部屋で、ベッドが2つに、布団が2つある部屋ですよ。それで、誰がベッドを使いますか？」僕はそう、3人に聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1611.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"4FAE37E2-8035-4ACD-A363-C0FEC153244D","title":"シーン 1612","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1612スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は、どっちでもいいわよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1612.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"611F6233-2EDB-4292-888D-36BE0CB8A29F","title":"シーン 1613","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1613スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、ベッドがいいな…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1613.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（微笑）.png"},{"id":"C549FB7B-BFFB-4F26-A380-5494E01F000E","title":"シーン 1614","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1614スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は、紅夢さんの意見に合わせますよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1614.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"517FFD57-4C83-4D12-AD65-CF393F2E88AB","title":"シーン 1615","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1615スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それじゃあ、ベッドはこいしさんとさとりさん、\n布団で寝るのは、僕とアリスさんで構いませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1615.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"963DEA55-513C-4FC4-BCC5-DB19B6C96BDA","title":"シーン 1616","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1616スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう言うと、3人は頷き、その通りになった。\n「それで、アリスさんは、これからどうしますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1616.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"DDC22568-62B0-4DA7-B3AB-E919809B60EA","title":"シーン 1617","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1617スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「特にやりたいこともないわよ…、何か計画でもあるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1617.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6C21D31A-6027-4819-8225-34B245ED76BB","title":"シーン 1618","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1618スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、少しばかし考え込む。こいしとさとりが休んでいる間に、アリスと出かけてもいいのかな…と。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1618.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"2D02FF01-F710-4758-B38C-3579C0656EB5","title":"シーン 1619","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1619スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私たちのことは、今は気にしなくていいよ、紅夢。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1619.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6E78769A-8640-4B04-B38D-65EA8C084477","title":"シーン 1620","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1620スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、少しばかし昼食のタイミングが遅くなるかもしれませんが、それで、大丈夫なら…、提案できますけど…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1620.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"0703441A-0CE7-40B5-8D7A-3C510EC6F69C","title":"シーン 1621","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1621スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「分かった…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1621.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"AD211F73-0E9F-4397-A8F9-2A57024FE69E","title":"シーン 1622","duration":3.7,"slideTitle":"第1622スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それなら、近くに観光スポットがあるので、\nそこに行きますか？アリスさん？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1622.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"399D4A3C-4140-403F-A3FC-F1BF09446770","title":"シーン 1623","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1623スライド","backgroundName":"image71.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「分かったわ。それじゃあ、行きましょうか…。」\n私は、それから彼と共に観光スポットに車で向かった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1623.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image71.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（微笑）.png"},{"id":"F6D7410C-3A74-4B20-9814-E72D40CABE34","title":"（名無し）（主人公の副人格）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1624.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/微笑.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"B97ECC4F-E7CE-4981-B767-3655803A2F03","title":"シーン 1625","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1625スライド","backgroundName":"image72.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちはあれから、万座毛と言う場所に来ていた。すると、風がこっちに吹いてくる。「少しばかし、冷え込んでるな…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1625.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image72.jpeg"},{"id":"8C6D70D7-B412-4326-95FC-42CA9326536D","title":"シーン 1626","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1626スライド","backgroundName":"image72.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「なんだか、肌寒いわね…」私はそう、彼に呟く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1626.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image72.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CCFB2050-8104-46DF-8AB6-B08E12DE1DDD","title":"シーン 1627","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1627スライド","backgroundName":"image72.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「確かにそうですね…。とりあえず、施設に戻りますか…。」\nそれから僕たちは、ここにくる前に通った案内施設に戻った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1627.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image72.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"46294E2B-D2C6-4D16-831F-80B36DCD9B4C","title":"霧雨魔理沙（主人公の母の友人）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1628.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霧雨魔理沙_通常.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"B6CF807A-2DCC-48C2-8D24-6B048BB4CB6C","title":"シーン 1629","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1629スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕とアリスがホテルに早めに戻ると、僕が提案した、\n全国展開をしているステーキハウスに四人でやってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1629.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg"},{"id":"E68F982A-F880-4BB1-8CB2-DA6ACCE9081A","title":"シーン 1630","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1630スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、お店に入ると券売機で、事前に注文と支払いを済ませ、テーブル席に着くと、各自でサラダやご飯などを用意する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1630.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg"},{"id":"7AEBA101-9E07-413F-AC38-91B9B6D6DF9F","title":"シーン 1631","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1631スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、こいしさんとさとりさんは、何を頼んだんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1631.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（微笑）.png"},{"id":"E0447A96-F106-4E5B-8FD1-474082C2B16D","title":"シーン 1632","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1632スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、チョップステーキ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1632.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（微笑）.png"},{"id":"BBCA6050-79DC-41FE-BE39-BD08213F8705","title":"シーン 1633","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1633スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は、普通のステーキを頼みました。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1633.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"533ED25B-78D1-4662-A589-697963596D89","title":"シーン 1634","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1634スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、それで、この後はどうしますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1634.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/こいし（微笑）.png"},{"id":"1F55A5C7-E478-46DB-AE26-61D942AFBB1F","title":"シーン 1635","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1635スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、海で泳ぎたいな…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1635.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"D5D7564A-05CB-4FDD-A473-433D4AE01307","title":"シーン 1636","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1636スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「さとりさんは、この後、何がしたいですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1636.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"FF9773E8-45FA-43F3-9818-7158BD0AC3B1","title":"シーン 1637","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1637スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は…特にないので、紅夢さんたちに合わせますよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1637.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"06796AF0-C400-4F8B-843F-A435AB0DA90E","title":"シーン 1638","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1638スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が何かに、言い淀んでいる感じがし、それを尋ねる。\n「何か、言いたいことがあるんじゃないですか…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1638.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"3BB3ADD8-648C-472C-AA78-D8B1A03C96F1","title":"シーン 1639","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1639スライド","backgroundName":"image73.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は表情が一瞬だけ、変わる。だが、直後に注文したステーキが運ばれてきたのでは、それは聞けずじまいになった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1639.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image73.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/ねぇ」.png"},{"id":"46C05413-5781-4554-A85A-65F572DAA01C","title":"古明地さとり（主人公のクラスメイト）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1640.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとりごくり.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"7E84D0A9-4097-4EAB-9689-33A4808CCCDF","title":"シーン 1641","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1641スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、ステーキハウスからホテルに戻る途中にある小さな、市民ビーチに来ていた。周りには人が一人もいなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1641.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg"},{"id":"78660D5C-AF28-4B18-B95B-6419A504C754","title":"シーン 1642","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1642スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「紅夢くんも一緒に、海で泳ごうよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1642.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.tiff"},{"id":"0957D3F9-E74A-4FAF-B55E-81539B77DD83","title":"シーン 1643","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1643スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いや、僕は泳げないので…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1643.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.tiff"},{"id":"521FCE1C-168D-4D78-8B1A-158499D2E34D","title":"シーン 1644","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1644スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1644.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"BA2017ED-D850-4133-A526-F629BD4AA54F","title":"シーン 1645","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1645スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それじゃあ、私は海で泳いでくるね！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1645.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.tiff"},{"id":"8075D11F-264D-4E92-8889-8F141DF8835D","title":"シーン 1646","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1646スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、海の方へと駆け出していった。\n僕は、ふと砂浜に座り込むと、アリスが声をかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1646.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg"},{"id":"60C19C87-F38D-4BF6-8DE7-02814D2E2159","title":"シーン 1647","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1647スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの、いいんですか？こいしさんだけはしゃいでしまって。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1647.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"15F7F659-F40F-46A6-A0F3-9258BD76A269","title":"シーン 1648","duration":3.6,"slideTitle":"第1648スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「別にいいですよ。僕は、\nその姿を遠くから見るだけで十分満足ですから…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1648.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"00B15A05-986D-4EAF-8B14-E6C2516BF578","title":"シーン 1649","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1649スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あなた、それ本音なのですか？」\n私は、彼の発言に思わず驚き、そう尋ねてしまう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1649.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"F2A8CFA3-A23C-44C8-9160-18269CADE374","title":"シーン 1650","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1650スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうですけど…、それが何か？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1650.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"B4599F00-AA9E-4968-A5FC-206CF1C3B0B3","title":"シーン 1651","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1651スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「私は知りませんからね…、そんな考えで彼女に接しても…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1651.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"B8958BB8-B3CF-45BB-9A4B-B058D216D731","title":"シーン 1652","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1652スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が何を言いたいのかが、分からなかった。\nだが、海ではしゃぐこいしの姿を見て、ほのぼのとした。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1652.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"ACEC0C9A-2A44-4F81-81F9-D31C1996CC27","title":"シーン 1653","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1653スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あの、私の存在を忘れてはいませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1653.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（怒る）.png"},{"id":"C89ACB10-38E8-4046-87A9-83D9F49760A2","title":"シーン 1654","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1654スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女がそう言っていると、突如強風が吹く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1654.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"C5451B1A-85AF-43EB-859B-0B31867F94E9","title":"シーン 1655","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1655スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、遠くで遊んでいるこいしの水着が舞い上がる。\nそれと同時に、中に隠れている何かが見えた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1655.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"A2ABD82D-6F23-4DFE-B3C9-2B6E8FB9301D","title":"シーン 1656","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1656スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、今私の水着の中、見たでしょ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1656.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"6B2C9674-E6B2-40CB-BAA7-B9996D7A9B9D","title":"シーン 1657","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1657スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ…、確かに見えましたけど…」\n僕がそう言うと、彼女は強烈なビンタをしてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1657.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"AB843098-2273-4F4C-A0FE-AC4B391F7384","title":"シーン 1658","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1658スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あなたね…、デリカシーっていうものはないのかしら？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1658.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"B7CE7C30-ECE8-48FD-8028-827F82C34284","title":"シーン 1659","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1659スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ…？」僕がそう返すと、もう一度彼女はビンタをする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1659.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"0A506C05-6AFD-4E89-A0DF-4E730D1256D1","title":"シーン 1660","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1660スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「もういいわ…、この旅行が終わったら、\nあんたを奪い取るんだから…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1660.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"6217CE18-6394-4D44-8747-4E230FB5502A","title":"シーン 1661","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1661スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、首を傾げる僕を置き去りにしたまま、数時間ほど、一度も岸に戻らず、海をただ泳ぎ続けるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1661.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg"},{"id":"49A7B898-4487-45A5-8B7E-9AFB89D78289","title":"シーン 1662","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1662スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕とさとりとアリスはただそれを眺めるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1662.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg"},{"id":"39A6DE02-B954-405F-A8FE-DF45C1C9E351","title":"藤原妹紅（主人公の父親）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1663.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/やる.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"BF5BB913-A6E3-4438-9C47-3D08070D7F42","title":"シーン 1664","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1664スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"あれから、数時間経つと、こいしがトボトボと岸に戻ってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1664.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"6F287823-D494-4CE2-B3A6-F3AFA7CA8A62","title":"シーン 1665","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1665スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ…お兄ちゃんは海で、泳がなくてよかったの…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1665.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"BA0257C0-D7B9-4B78-AF11-F5D508FBB41A","title":"シーン 1666","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1666スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、その問いかけに衝撃を受け、時間が止まったのかと思ってしまう。それは、アリスとさとりも同じみたいだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1666.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"33726199-33E0-492E-B960-7455F7C73408","title":"シーン 1667","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1667スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女は、そういうと、いきなり僕に倒れかかってくる。\n僕は、それを受け止めると、そっと、彼女を背中に背負う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1667.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"93F5D400-E86F-4792-923B-912358CD6184","title":"シーン 1668","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1668スライド","backgroundName":"image74.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、背後からついてくる二人の機嫌が悪くなっているのを感じながら、こいしを起こさぬように、車までおんぶしていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1668.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image74.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（怒り）.png"},{"id":"2EDC58ED-4AA4-4F77-9A72-36297232FAFC","title":"レミリア・スカーレット（紅魔建設代表）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1669.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリアジト涙目.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"618DCB2D-0BF9-4445-A231-58AFC62E88C4","title":"シーン 1670","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1670スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それからホテルに戻る。そして、こいしは車内で目覚め、頬照りながら、せっせと部屋の浴室に駆け込んで行った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1670.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg"},{"id":"943616FB-56BD-4BD4-B802-057E343CD572","title":"シーン 1671","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1671スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、僕たちは、窓に差し込む夕陽を眺めていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1671.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg"},{"id":"690137FB-415C-49AE-84A0-2560568B88A7","title":"シーン 1672","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1672スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「それで、今晩の夕食はどうするの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1672.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"7B528807-B645-4B22-B460-0ABDACC2634D","title":"シーン 1673","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1673スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「今晩は、ホテル内のレストランでバイキングですよ。もちろん、お酒が飲みたいなら、ホテル内のバーにもいいですけど。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1673.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"ADED6DB0-8638-4863-B54F-58F91C6DD534","title":"シーン 1674","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1674スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「それって、自由にお酒が飲めるってこと？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1674.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"56ED365E-EDBC-4A1C-919B-83D8C398CE65","title":"シーン 1675","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1675スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、昨日は不意打ちでしたが、今晩は夕食後に部屋に戻る二人とアリスさんと僕で別行動の予定ですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1675.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"43F90A72-A5F2-47C4-B34F-B9CA24285F23","title":"シーン 1676","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1676スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それだと、こいしがまた怒り出しそうだけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1676.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"EB759A83-3523-4E91-B70A-D8BB6F2E5BE5","title":"シーン 1677","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1677スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そこで、一つ名案です。」僕はそう言いながら、ある券が入った首からぶら下げるカードケースをさとりにかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1677.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"394DFE88-79B5-404D-BC8E-8909AF747756","title":"シーン 1678","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1678スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「これは…何？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1678.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"8501C9CD-2E02-4BD6-877F-9090F31DDBF4","title":"シーン 1679","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1679スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ナイトプールの利用券ですよ。その券を見せれば、最大二人まで、日付が変わるまで遊び放題なので、楽しんでください。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1679.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"7F56B5C9-1DB0-42FD-B5F9-E98A64B7E296","title":"シーン 1680","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1680スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「えっ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1680.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（驚く）.png"},{"id":"A0A8D633-B0BC-4CFF-B0B3-16F4FB76454A","title":"シーン 1681","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1681スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「後一つ、もしナイトプールで寝ることなく、日付が変わるまで遊び尽くしたら、僕からお祝いがあると言ってください。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1681.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"1848B5A9-9276-4428-A320-5EDEA5036B60","title":"シーン 1682","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1682スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ただし、事故が起きるのも嫌なので、その限度は弁えることができるように、さとりさんが彼女を見ててください。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1682.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"936555D0-E40D-4C22-A711-A3CEE1B421C9","title":"シーン 1683","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1683スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あの、いいんですか…、\n彼女がそこまであなたに甘えさせてもらっても…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1683.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（困る）.png"},{"id":"DF4DB78B-8361-4FA9-BD86-008EE2394A91","title":"シーン 1684","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1684スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「彼女が、純粋に僕に甘えられるのは、この旅行までなんですから、残りの短い期間、思う存分甘えさせたくはないですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1684.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"2BEF3596-86A9-4990-9D70-8962BC7FB24E","title":"シーン 1685","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1685スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「分かりました…、ただ覚悟してくださいね…、彼女は人に懐くと固執しがちでヤキモチも妬きやすいので…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1685.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（困る）.png"},{"id":"DD6D2A6B-580D-4A75-8140-5A6CE395431A","title":"シーン 1686","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1686スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それくらいできてますよ。それに、さとりさんとアリスさんも本当なら、彼女みたいに…したくはありませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1686.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"03677C58-2780-486A-8DFD-8F4571EC320D","title":"シーン 1687","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1687スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそういうと、二人とも驚いた様子を浮かべる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1687.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（驚く）.png"},{"id":"CC9EAB17-A7F8-4374-B9D5-ED4EDCE8AF2D","title":"シーン 1688","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1688スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あなたには…勝てませんよ…」私は、思わずそう呟く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1688.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（困る）.png"},{"id":"05907C5F-BB9E-48E8-9B37-1DE65B2EEE22","title":"シーン 1689","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1689スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私も、さとりさんの意見に同感ですよ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1689.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"85F6787C-8135-44CD-A733-884615C721A0","title":"シーン 1690","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1690スライド","backgroundName":"image75.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕たち3人は、こいしの入浴を終えると、夕食会場に向かい、夕食を済ますと、それぞれ別行動を取るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1690.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image75.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"67D2F616-EFA7-4383-9D86-D041F8A23ACF","title":"シーン 1691","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1691スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それから夕飯を済ますと、さとりとこいしはナイトプールに向かい、僕とアリスはバーにやってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1691.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg"},{"id":"34BE6155-9FEB-4336-A37F-CB9F246763F0","title":"シーン 1692","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1692スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「なんだか、今日は色々あって疲れちゃったわ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1692.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"C0F5C597-A652-4C35-956F-1A295C4A3CBA","title":"シーン 1693","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1693スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「確かに、その通りですね…。」僕は、彼女にそう返す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1693.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1120D09C-AB7A-42B4-BFBB-176946356D9C","title":"シーン 1694","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1694スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、そんな話をしていると、注文したファーストドリンクがやってくる。彼女は、白ワインで、僕は〇〇〇〇を頼んだ。\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1694.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"72C1B18D-79B3-47E6-9D39-F7D8CFE61D96","title":"シーン 1695","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1695スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、互いにやってきたグラスを持って、お互いにしか聞こえない音量で、「乾杯。」というと、ごくごくと飲む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1695.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E8528A50-AFC8-4FCD-9D10-149411250D30","title":"シーン 1696","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1696スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、彼女から色々な話や愚痴などを、僕は聞いていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1696.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3F6152AA-0C64-4C31-9775-B2D37DB0E978","title":"シーン 1697","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1697スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕は数時間ほど彼女の話を聞いていると、時刻は夜の9時ごろを指していた。「そろそろ、部屋に戻りますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1697.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（怒り）.png"},{"id":"03470514-6E49-4C26-AB06-01513CEB002C","title":"シーン 1698","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1698スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「確かに、そろそろ戻ったほうがいいわね…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1698.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"7D767D94-A9B7-410F-8A3E-D073EEAA9506","title":"シーン 1699","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1699スライド","backgroundName":"nc232269_バー.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女の意思を確認すると、席を立ち上がる。僕は、彼女が席を立つと、そっと手を繋ぐ。そして、部屋に向けて歩き出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1699.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc232269_バー.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困る）.png"},{"id":"7AB64B72-930A-48AE-81D0-0018C54D1BD7","title":"シーン 1700","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1700スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが部屋に戻ったときには、まだこいしとさとりのすがたはなかった。そして、彼女は、そのまま入浴を始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1700.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"1E4BB4E9-4189-489D-BDD5-0ADED88E4246","title":"シーン 1701","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1701スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ふと暇になり、テレビをつける。すると、テレビでは地下底国グループが突如、発表したご令嬢の今後について流れていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1701.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"C9DDB3BB-BF69-4C12-B0B0-A1A3F8739467","title":"シーン 1702","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1702スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それも、ご令嬢は以前から、次期グループの長に適した婿養子を取ることが決まっていて、その候補の名前は不明となっていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1702.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"976B2FC1-201F-47F1-B972-2FBFEA14C853","title":"シーン 1703","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1703スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、その発表では、目的人物が決まったとされ、そして、紅魔建設や学園で同タイミングでの発表から、憶測がされていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1703.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"A3F3F2AB-C052-4B11-B17F-A07D6E83DBEF","title":"シーン 1704","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1704スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、そのテレビの報道を見る限り、あくまで噂程度だった。\nそれでも、僕はなんとなく、自分の将来を不安に感じた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1704.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"DC85C0B8-0E78-4EF7-8494-DE2C15D49B3E","title":"シーン 1705","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1705スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、報道の内容が、グールプの今までの流れとこいしやさとりが小さかった頃のことがピックアップされていく。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1705.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"AFEF78D9-1CCA-48A2-85D1-02DF79761D95","title":"シーン 1706","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1706スライド","backgroundName":"image76.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、その報道を集中して見てたからか、アリスが肩を叩くまで、彼女が入浴を終えたことに気が付かなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1706.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image76.jpeg"},{"id":"CE9103F7-4FFD-48CA-A075-3A6556ED9FC4","title":"東風谷早苗（主人公がいるクラスの担任）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1707.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/早苗（微笑）.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"D8BFA3B0-4889-4F6A-87ED-EA29DA644AAD","title":"シーン 1708","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1708スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が入浴を終えると、僕とアリスは、寝るための布団を敷き談笑をしていた。すると、いきなり部屋の扉が開く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1708.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り笑い.png"},{"id":"018FBCA7-543A-4A5B-B16E-C4926E674EDB","title":"シーン 1709","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1709スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして入ってきたのは、暗い影と涙があるこいしだった。\n彼女は入ってくるや否や、ドアを急いで閉めて、鍵をかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1709.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"9FF0648C-5B29-4087-9CD3-D70C756AD40A","title":"シーン 1710","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1710スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、廊下の方からドンドンとドアを叩く音がする。\nそして、こいしは僕に抱きつき、泣きながら言葉を出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1710.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"203292DE-487A-4609-A140-AFECB4288AD5","title":"シーン 1711","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1711スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「お兄ちゃん…、助けて…、お姉ちゃんが…、お姉ちゃんが…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1711.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"F04257B6-6812-414B-AE38-58EAB4B82128","title":"シーン 1712","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1712スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女が小さくそう呟きがなら、ひたすら泣き、僕は事態を把握する。廊下の人物は、扉を叩く代わりにをこじ開けようとする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1712.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"DA6C7B62-2F02-4C11-B5AA-1298D9B1A021","title":"シーン 1713","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1713スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ここはこいしの頭をそっと撫でて、少しだけ落ち着かせると、部屋の電話を取り、ロビーに電話をかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1713.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"42691405-881F-4739-8B7C-F8D56B9FB0A1","title":"シーン 1714","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1714スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、さらに時間が経ち、こいしがそのまま泣き疲れて、僕の腕の中で眠り出した頃には、廊下は静かになっていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1714.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"293154C1-D8C0-4BC5-BEDC-C0AA402B0BF5","title":"シーン 1715","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1715スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、こいしをベッドで寝かせ、アリスもいつの間にか就寝していることを知ると、部屋の電話である場所に電話をかける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1715.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"CEF18D1F-5BC1-4B2B-AA8A-9C6A3900E931","title":"シーン 1716","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1716スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「もしもし、どちら様ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1716.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"19EF7676-01A9-4CDF-B526-02C2D822217E","title":"シーン 1717","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1717スライド","backgroundName":"image77.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「レミリアさん…、僕からのお願いを聞いてくれませんか…。」\n僕はそう言い始め、今までの出来事をそのまま伝えていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1717.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image77.jpeg"},{"id":"29CEF542-730A-4112-B4E7-8001A0D758DB","title":"紅美鈴（学園の体育科担当教員）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1718.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/目閉じ困る.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"28B28F4F-43A0-41DA-AD2F-A39041A044EB","title":"シーン 1719","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1719スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「んっ…」僕は、あれからふと気がつくと、窓から朝日が差し込んでいた。レミリアとの電話の後、僕はそのまま眠った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1719.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg"},{"id":"C7BB02B9-8B53-4F38-B266-8AA4E291DCF3","title":"シーン 1720","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1720スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして周りを見ると、こいしとアリスも目が覚めたみたいだった。そして、さとりは部屋にはいなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1720.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/生成された画像.png"},{"id":"9893A109-7128-4619-8F55-C3EC94F1FAB2","title":"シーン 1721","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1721スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「お姉ちゃんはどこにいるの…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1721.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"69196919-8204-4260-B203-EB1DAEF300B2","title":"シーン 1722","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1722スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そう聞いてくる彼女に、昨夜のナイトプールで一体何があったのかを、優しく尋ねると、彼女は泣きながら、説明をした。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1722.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E4B7910E-A1FA-4D85-B341-2A525E8DF4E3","title":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ（学園の科学担当教員兼博士）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1723.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パチュリー真顔小口開け.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"A6C13AC5-AFAC-4AE1-8FED-7BB1E608DC96","title":"シーン 1724","duration":4.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1724スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それで、これから、どうするの…？\nお姉ちゃんは、あの人たちに捕まっているけど…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1724.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FDB11776-39F4-431D-AA21-74CB8CBD1EB6","title":"シーン 1725","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1725スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"こいしは、着替えた後にそう僕に聞いてくる。「とりあえず、ホテル内の安全確保はできたので、朝食を取りませんか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1725.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3E05B282-EA5F-4D14-80BD-DE80CE0CDA3C","title":"シーン 1726","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1726スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1726.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"8F17FBC3-EE6A-49EB-9F46-901F34AE2379","title":"シーン 1727","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1727スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいしさんのいう、邪道派が昨日、襲ってきた彼らなら、きっとまたやってくるはずです。いずれは、戦いましょう。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1727.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E8CD14CE-D3C5-406D-A3A3-3176BF6433C1","title":"シーン 1728","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1728スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「わかった…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1728.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"1FEEFA3F-9A2C-4B0D-BB43-6CB341A9EA34","title":"シーン 1729","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1729スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちがそう話していると、部屋の電話が鳴る。受話器を取ると、ロビーの人から通話相手を知り、繋げてもらう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1729.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"16AA8ED4-DF4E-4680-8183-EBCA341028FA","title":"シーン 1730","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1730スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「もしもし…、フランさん？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1730.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"01FA95EE-71CD-464E-AD57-6BA9F2DA8A5C","title":"シーン 1731","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1731スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢、昨日、お姉様に伝えてくれたお願いに、応えることにしたの、それで私が、今飛行機に乗るから、ホテルで待ってて。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1731.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"FE45A95D-BEA6-48CB-AAD2-A97E97BF4907","title":"シーン 1732","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1732スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「わかりました。今日の間は、ホテルから出ないように、言っておきますね。」僕は、それと部屋番号を言うと、電話を切った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1732.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"A80C3F35-D3BA-4D92-9FE1-EDA2433A1FDC","title":"シーン 1733","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1733スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「今、フランさんから連絡があって、あと数分で出発する飛行機に乗ったようなので、昼過ぎには、こっちに着くそうです。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1733.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"212EE3C2-8126-4934-84B3-B41461441AA1","title":"シーン 1734","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1734スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…、ありがとう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1734.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"2C8947AD-2960-42B8-AEC5-63DBEEDDE528","title":"シーン 1735","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1735スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「とりあえず、朝食をホテルのレストランで取ったら、フランさんが着くまでの間は、部屋の中で待ってるのが安全ですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1735.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CD011E1F-012C-4AE7-85F5-86185479F494","title":"シーン 1736","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1736スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「わかった…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1736.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"C282A1BF-2F39-41F2-B930-D1B090EC273F","title":"シーン 1737","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1737スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから僕たちは、朝食を済ませたあと、\nフランがホテルに着くまでの間、部屋の中で過ごすのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1737.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CF4B6A4D-7C32-4F8C-9643-E1B543F21B43","title":"十六夜咲夜（学園の家庭科担当教員）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"咲夜頬照り困った笑み.png","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1738.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/咲夜頬照り困った笑み.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"0A4CCA5C-F2EA-4043-AB87-6CE8B72F0D08","title":"シーン 1739","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1739スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、いろいろと話していると、部屋のチャイムが鳴る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1739.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"B5CCE713-DF6A-4164-BDCF-6A1F193FE691","title":"シーン 1740","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1740スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢は大丈夫だったの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1740.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"67E020F6-37B6-4B8B-B55C-BAEC2F1C0045","title":"シーン 1741","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1741スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ。僕とアリスさんは無事ですが、こいしさんとさとりさんが襲撃にあったみたいで、さとりさんが連れ去られました…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1741.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6588D1CA-9601-4477-A786-8CC970D4B83B","title":"シーン 1742","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1742スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…、とりあえず、これからどうするの？\n旅行を続けるわけじゃないんでしょ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1742.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5B82091E-2C40-4F7D-BB43-4983E99DB710","title":"シーン 1743","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1743スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「まだ…今後のことは決めてないです。\n何よりこいしさんは、連絡手段がないので…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1743.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"839E7076-E8C1-4CD3-87DE-4DC7698C7168","title":"シーン 1744","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1744スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…。」私がそう言っていると、私のポケベルがなる。\n「ちょっと、電話してくるから、待ってて。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1744.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"9E35D5BC-9975-439A-A68D-E1E2BD16B8B9","title":"シーン 1745","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1745スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"フランはそう言うと、部屋を出て行った。\n「それで、アリスさんとこいしさんは何か希望はありますか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1745.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"DDD10F05-7CD6-4D1D-944A-B45BF455E688","title":"シーン 1746","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1746スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「私は、安全が一番だと思うけど…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1746.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"7E82E906-6AC6-44A4-9F01-6977445EDF1C","title":"シーン 1747","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1747スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、こいしさんは？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1747.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"92629ABE-EAE9-4FBD-BB06-852C07448ADA","title":"シーン 1748","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1748スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私は、特に希望はないけど…もうあんな目に遭うのはやだ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1748.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6988E4F2-A0B7-426E-B6B6-716EB5E41E6F","title":"シーン 1749","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1749スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…。とりあえず、彼女が戻るのを待ちますか…」\n僕たちは、不安を抱えながら、フランが戻るのを待った。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1749.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"E87436BD-893C-4CD0-ABAC-514BCFB5B01A","title":"伊吹萃香（学園の体育科担当教員）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1750.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/怒る.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"B7FD7327-21A8-4665-99EA-397359D2EFCC","title":"シーン 1751","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1751スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちがそれから、数十分ほど待っていると、フランが部屋の扉を再び開き、戻ってきた。そして、あることを告げる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1751.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"CD0B1D4A-6319-405D-A9B5-2C316BA81FE8","title":"シーン 1752","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1752スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「今、お姉様が、こいしさんの両親と協議して、一時的に私たちたちの家で、こいしさんを預かることにしたって連絡が来た。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1752.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"5FBDE725-4F99-4866-8C31-F5B2149AAC27","title":"シーン 1753","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1753スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、彼女の両親はなんと言ってましたか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1753.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3E98D3FC-07B7-4037-8222-F54BB6550B6D","title":"シーン 1754","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1754スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「今、地下底国グループで派閥争いが起きていて、とてもじゃないけど彼女を家に帰らせるわけにはいかないって。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1754.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"3E14BCAF-DF1C-4CBC-915B-56D7BB473B46","title":"シーン 1755","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1755スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「それと、こないだの突如の発表は、一旦無効にして、状況が落ち着くまで、私やお姉様と協力するって言ってた。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1755.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"6D3C10BE-D22E-4DB3-B085-5A064571D8EC","title":"シーン 1756","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1756スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1756.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"23F746EA-7F5F-402C-A890-79EB083BFAD6","title":"シーン 1757","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1757スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、空港に戻って、私たちの家に帰る、それでいい？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1757.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"75C3FDB1-6899-4255-BF23-65E7EC3A3E15","title":"シーン 1758","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1758スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「あの私は…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1758.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"A444A50E-3E6A-487D-9D7A-661CA39C538C","title":"シーン 1759","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1759スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、自由行動で構いませんよ。ただ、もし、もう少し滞在するなら、少しばかし手続きが必要ですが…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1759.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"0BEAFC1B-78CA-44E5-8E6D-6E6AD3F7AFE2","title":"シーン 1760","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1760スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","telop":"「じゃあ、私も家に帰ろうかしら…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1760.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"0A1AF3A5-CE3E-4F2A-8FBB-0F34AD908B94","title":"シーン 1761","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1761スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいしさんは、それで大丈夫ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1761.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"BCB42D7D-42AF-4E17-8207-466BE35776F0","title":"シーン 1762","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1762スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それでいいよ…、もう一度危険な目には遭いたくないし…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1762.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"EAA6E024-DD4D-478F-8E1C-77DAA012B6ED","title":"シーン 1763","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1763スライド","backgroundName":"image78.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、二人の意見を把握すると、そのままフランが先導する形で、フランたちの家に帰っていくのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1763.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image78.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/アリス（困り）.png"},{"id":"C133863D-DC12-4815-92BD-A8E9458D38E6","title":"シーン 1764","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1764スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"あれから、僕たちは家に帰り、レミリアとフランにいろいろと説明をしていると、あっという間に時間が過ぎ、夕飯時になった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1764.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png"},{"id":"DDF7C8D4-03C6-4670-8A40-6B40ADA8FF08","title":"シーン 1765","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1765スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、今はレミリアとフランになぜか説教されていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1765.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂怒り目開き.png"},{"id":"C8CC454E-22AB-4112-BDF9-69E13C312F07","title":"シーン 1766","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1766スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「まったく、留守電を残していたとはいえ、\n何で私たちに相談もせずに、勝手に行動をするのよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1766.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂怒り目開き.png"},{"id":"FC61B330-0B9A-4A9D-A5B4-30547B4078D9","title":"シーン 1767","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1767スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「次こう言うことがあったら、お仕置きだからね。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1767.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/フラン（怒る）.png"},{"id":"3324BBC7-AA8E-41F2-AFAC-253B134E34F2","title":"シーン 1768","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1768スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「まぁ、今更言ったって、過ぎたことは仕方ないし、今日はこれくらいにしておくわ。今は、彼女の身の安全が優先だからね。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1768.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリア（困り）.png"},{"id":"4B850D71-4A33-4117-9C5A-9F4F748A91F6","title":"シーン 1769","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1769スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、困った様子を浮かべるこいしを向く。\nそして、そこで会話が途切れ、沈黙の時間が流れた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1769.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"BB37D51A-0BDA-42CF-BAAC-6849EAE697E2","title":"シーン 1770","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1770スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは夕飯を食べ終えると、歯を磨き、\nこいしとともに元々フランと僕の二人部屋だった部屋に来た。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1770.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"6975ADD6-508E-413D-950D-184ECE065F92","title":"シーン 1771","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1771スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「何だか…ごめんなさい…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1771.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"BCB893B6-765F-4F93-A7C8-2B7950A86B26","title":"シーン 1772","duration":3.7,"slideTitle":"第1772スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいしさんが謝る必要はないですよ。\n僕とフランさんたちとの問題なので…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1772.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"ACE92F6B-61B0-4EF7-A4D0-EF0661D67902","title":"シーン 1773","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1773スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1773.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"1A4A7FEB-700B-4480-8EB9-04FDBF4D71AA","title":"シーン 1774","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1774スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、そう話していると、玄関の方から、物音がする。\nだが、すっと静かになり、僕は気にせず、ただボーっとする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1774.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"454F82C3-9507-4428-BD3A-5C119CDF4837","title":"シーン 1775","duration":3.8000000000000003,"slideTitle":"第1775スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、部屋の扉がノックされる。\n僕は、特に気にも止めずに、部屋の扉を開ける。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1775.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ汗なし困り.png"},{"id":"8B6CF7B2-18DF-48E0-9B60-64C04DE95314","title":"シーン 1776","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1776スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あら、こいし。こんなところにいたの。\nほら、私たちの家に帰りますよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1776.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/さとり（微笑）.png"},{"id":"EE02D8DF-FC83-44F7-B363-59F33EFD4280","title":"シーン 1777","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1777スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふとこいしの方を見ると、彼女には恐怖の表情を浮かべていた。僕は、そこで瞬時にこいしの前に立つ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1777.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ恐怖.png"},{"id":"99E0308E-D733-4BE8-97B0-B0C8952AAF36","title":"シーン 1778","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1778スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あら、紅夢さん、どうしたんですか？私は妹を連れて帰るだけですよ。それとも…私がどうかしたのですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1778.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖笑い.png"},{"id":"CD8526A9-7863-4723-B04B-F03812A49581","title":"シーン 1779","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1779スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"僕は、彼女がそう言った瞬間に、脳裏にあるものが浮かぶ。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1779.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖笑い.png"},{"id":"C160F967-9F4F-4FBD-91F0-EB5B01D9127E","title":"シーン 1780","duration":1.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"image56.pxd","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1780.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/image56.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/フラン（狂気）.pxd","animationDuration":1.0},{"id":"B5362ADC-9E89-49F0-9864-BE25101270D6","title":"シーン 1781","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1781スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ぜぇぜぇとした息を吐きながら、彼女に言う。\n「あなたは…、さとりさんでは…、ありません…、誰ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1781.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖笑い.png"},{"id":"0AB75575-89AF-4985-8AD7-9C322B7BFFE6","title":"シーン 1782","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1782スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「私は、古明地さとりですよ。あなたこそ、さっきから苦しそうにしてますけど？ほら、帰るわよこいし。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1782.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖笑い.png"},{"id":"5133DEB0-02F0-4D78-9FD7-7815D6E72510","title":"シーン 1783","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1783スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女がこいしに手を伸ばすと、押さえ込んでいたものが浮き上がり、意識が途切れると、彼女に襲いかかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1783.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/恐怖笑い.png"},{"id":"B7C6D35E-D17A-481A-9F4D-5F99C30927FF","title":"八意永琳（主人公の担当医）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1784.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/永琳.psd","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"D5C1B122-A5DE-4216-ABC0-020AFABC2227","title":"シーン 1785","duration":6.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1785スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこには服が敗れた状態で、寝ているさとりの姿があった。そして、部屋の隅には、泣きながら眠るこいしの姿があった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1785.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/弱った寝顔.png"},{"id":"CAB8FC98-EFF4-4B16-836A-07BFB6C2DBE6","title":"シーン 1786","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1786スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それを頭で理解すると同時に、とてつもない恐怖心に襲われ、そのままずるずると後ずさる。すると、部屋の扉が開く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1786.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/弱った寝顔.png"},{"id":"92080679-36A2-44C5-9C62-0F312050BC8A","title":"シーン 1787","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1787スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がその扉の方に振り向くと、そこには怖い笑みを浮かべるフランとレミリアの姿があった。僕は、反射的に後ろに下がる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1787.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png"},{"id":"7F92E1F4-7136-4DBF-B0D7-B5013C397E0B","title":"シーン 1788","duration":6.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1788スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、僕の足に何かが当たる。そして、僕は挟み撃ちになっていることに気がつく。だが、金縛りにあったように手足が動かせない。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1788.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png"},{"id":"7CDE5858-4FE0-4CC1-844A-6B97F2379FCE","title":"シーン 1789","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1789スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、フランたちが今、まさに襲い掛かろうとした瞬間に、\nぷつりと何かが切れ、僕は、何かに意識を奪われた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1789.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/レミリア壊れたにやけ顔.png"},{"id":"7E4ED613-2E5C-4CC2-A119-2529AFF311F2","title":"摩多羅隠岐奈（学園長）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1790.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ微笑.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"1607A082-B8E3-49BD-8577-E34FA9A82C30","title":"シーン 1791","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1791スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、窓からは朝日が差し込んでいた。そして、ある違和感に気がつき、ベッドを降りる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1791.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd"},{"id":"919AC565-364A-4FA7-8789-F28A1F487113","title":"シーン 1792","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1792スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると地べたでは4人の女性が目覚めていた。「えっ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1792.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"BEA1E0B2-3A32-4446-A49D-3CDA3B830C60","title":"シーン 1793","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1793スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう呟くと、その4人は皆、困った表情をする。僕はそこで、昨晩の記憶を思い出そうとするが、一部分が欠けていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1793.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"C71117D9-CC8F-4174-A047-33E6E5C5CACE","title":"シーン 1794","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1794スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「あの…私、昨日何してましたっけ…？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1794.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"2D42DA0E-1729-4219-AEAF-84321313FF1F","title":"シーン 1795","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1795スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「私も…昨日、夕飯食べて、\nこの部屋に来たあたりから思い出せない…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1795.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"0702B033-9B9B-47AB-B1BE-2F428904AC25","title":"シーン 1796","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1796スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私は…、夕飯食べた後は、たしかお姉様と話し込んでて…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1796.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"757FA325-0947-46AC-81F2-DE2112A842A1","title":"シーン 1797","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1797スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「私は…フランと、私の部屋で、確かに、話し合っていたわ…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1797.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"46EABCF4-571B-455D-9CB0-8583B4855463","title":"シーン 1798","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1798スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、身だしなみを整えて、朝食を食べましょうか…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1798.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"AC625995-7E3C-4B77-95EF-15FBDB233A6B","title":"シーン 1799","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1799スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"レミリアがそう呟くと、僕たちも賛同し、各自が諸々を済ませると、食堂に集まり、朝食の時間になるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1799.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ寝起き顔.png"},{"id":"2B40D481-2FF7-4D5F-A257-68CB78128E9D","title":"射命丸文（学園の国語科教師）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1800.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/文ルイポスター寝起き.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"2BB0F437-10CC-4DF6-896B-D3C0A6617A38","title":"シーン 1801","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1801スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが朝食を済ますと、女性4人は、例の発表でいろいろ言いたいことを思い出したのか、4人だけで話し合いを始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1801.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"739E6730-43AB-4DB4-9C56-C9C98E9762BE","title":"シーン 1802","duration":3.7,"slideTitle":"第1802スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、暇つぶしがてら、図書館に来た。\nそして、適した本がないかどうかを探す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1802.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"5064073A-A61A-4A1C-9CC3-D16AF140BDAA","title":"シーン 1803","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1803スライド","backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ある本棚が僕を導いているように感じ、その本棚を見渡すと、魔法に関する本が、たくさん置かれていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1803.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg"},{"id":"34774EC0-4D6D-4ACF-8CB7-572800AFD015","title":"シーン 1804","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1804スライド","backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ある本を手に取ってみる。その本は著者の欄に、とある魔法使いと書かれていた。タイトルは魔法使い入門編だった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1804.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg"},{"id":"570D9D69-5CB4-4A9E-B4A4-3BB5B8B1BB35","title":"シーン 1805","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1805スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はその本を持ってくると、以前に使っていたスペースにある椅子に座り、その本を開く。そして、最初のページから読み始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1805.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"1126E105-C58C-4C08-A911-78B147DF5B71","title":"鈴仙・優曇華院・イナバ（学園の保健室の先生）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1806.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/鈴仙（微笑）.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"FECA14C0-AF99-4F84-90D0-5D1C7661890A","title":"シーン 1807","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1807スライド","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"私が、箒で履いていると、母が私のそばに近寄ってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacte