箒なし驚き.png"},{"id":"0666B0CE-7098-4421-80A0-0945BA066F5A","title":"シーン 1860","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1860スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「これは…、私が書いた本だな。それで、聞きたいことってのは？」私は、本を数分間眺めてそう言い、彼に返す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1860.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png"},{"id":"CDC34EC4-C467-4509-A7AD-692D9AE2582A","title":"シーン 1861","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1861スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうなんですか…。それで、魔理沙さんはこの本を見て、\nおかしいとこに気が付きましたか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1861.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png"},{"id":"9D4C6EEF-6D19-45B0-ACE6-BB05B8F51282","title":"シーン 1862","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1862スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「おかしいとこ…？どういう意味だ？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1862.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし疑問.png"},{"id":"CA1A0942-C51F-43C8-AFD5-073DA38879DF","title":"シーン 1863","duration":4.7,"slideTitle":"第1863スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「この本の表紙の著者の欄に、ラベルが貼ってあって、\n巻末の出典ページが破れていて、ないんですよ」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1863.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし疑問.png"},{"id":"BD6B5AA8-09AD-4DBA-AEFF-7A39BC358E68","title":"シーン 1864","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1864スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「ちょっと見せてくれないか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1864.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし疑問.png"},{"id":"46D5E84D-6697-4096-8607-63DF68C85B1A","title":"シーン 1865","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1865スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「別にいいですけど…。」僕はそう言い、再度本を渡す。\n「何か、理由でも見つかりましたか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1865.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし疑問.png"},{"id":"0AC96611-2626-4C05-BC2D-4030270434C9","title":"シーン 1866","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1866スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"私は、彼から本を受け取ると言われた場所をよく見る。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1866.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし疑問.png"},{"id":"114C7C37-D6B6-4638-B7A7-EBDBE7463360","title":"シーン 1867","duration":3.9000000000000004,"slideTitle":"第1867スライド","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ちょっと、私についてきてくれ。」\n私は、そう彼にいうと、自室に向かっていく。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1867.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし驚き.png"},{"id":"F1731F9C-B81B-4C79-9DF3-B467BBC419F6","title":"シーン 1868","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1868スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、彼女についていくと、そこはもともと僕が使っていた一人部屋だった。そして、彼女は何かを念じ始める。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1868.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし念じる.png"},{"id":"9CE6EE4E-9DD2-4612-AE70-5714E984FA99","title":"シーン 1869","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1869スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は左手を机の上に置いた本にドンと叩くように置く。すると、表紙に貼ってあったラベルがポロリと取れる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1869.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし見開き目口閉じ.png"},{"id":"CB548F24-BDBC-4740-AB99-48A29A08EFCE","title":"シーン 1870","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1870スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ふっ…」僕は、あっけなくラベルが取れてしまうその有様に、思わず苦笑してしまう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1870.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし見開き目口閉じ.png"},{"id":"657D198B-3FF5-4AFC-9325-3AB394C1C7B3","title":"シーン 1871","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1871スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「ほら、ラベルも取れて、巻末のページももとに戻ったぞ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1871.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし普通.png"},{"id":"DB0DFFB1-20ED-4467-B6DE-2E23A022DF0F","title":"シーン 1872","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1872スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女がそう言いながら、渡された本を見て、ある問題に気がつく。「魔理沙さん…これ…」僕はそう言いながら本を渡す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1872.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし普通.png"},{"id":"3D396B88-0F12-4867-AF33-557A7FD95F78","title":"シーン 1873","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1873スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「えっ…？」私は、彼に渡した本が再び渡され、よく見る。\nそこには、魔法であえて隠した暗い過去を示すものがあった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1873.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし影あり苦笑.png"},{"id":"EB8E40A2-B67C-4491-9AF8-47A698702C6C","title":"シーン 1874","duration":4.4,"slideTitle":"第1874スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"私は、一通りそれらを見ると、彼に手渡す。\n「この本が示す事実は、私とお前だけの秘密だぞ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1874.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし影あり苦笑.png"},{"id":"3BBB0A3B-3D86-4B64-98DD-3A589D5FD9A8","title":"シーン 1875","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1875スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言い、受け取った本を見ると、そこには僕が以前に通っていた男子校とほぼ同等の行為があったことを示していた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1875.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし影あり苦笑.png"},{"id":"1413CA34-029B-48FD-AD02-D7E9E95FA3E2","title":"シーン 1876","duration":4.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1876スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"それから、彼女は以前僕が通っていた男子校と、\n同じ陰湿なそれについて、１から話し出すのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1876.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙帽子箒なし苦笑涙.png"},{"id":"C35118F1-52BE-4592-BDAB-78D0A35C4C12","title":"魂魄妖夢（警察官）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1877.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/妖夢（微笑）.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"017C90B7-83CB-4F82-816F-CC0B8772E24D","title":"シーン 1878","duration":4.9,"slideTitle":"第1878スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、その話を聞き終えると、彼女は頭を振り、涙を拭い取り、微笑みながら、僕にあることを聞いてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1878.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png"},{"id":"227CB7A0-8519-4A59-8BDF-5F80B8A7007D","title":"シーン 1879","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1879スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","telop":"「それで、紅夢くんは魔法について知りたいのかい？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"霧雨魔理沙","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1879.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png"},{"id":"141F5DB2-9851-45E4-B67B-EF2E0462A73F","title":"シーン 1880","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1880スライド","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうです。それで…」僕はそれから、彼女に図書館で書いてきたノートを見せながら、聞きたいことを聞いていった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1880.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/魔理沙箒・帽子なし微笑.png"},{"id":"1B0FBA1D-E724-4E94-8357-F605F9D2ACEE","title":"先代の巫女（霊夢の母親）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1881.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/霊異変やっちまった.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"2A3BA333-B700-49A6-AFA0-8129D53E202F","title":"シーン 1882","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1882スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、魔理沙に聞きたいことを聞き終えると、\n今度から魔理沙に魔法の使い方を教えてもらえることになった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1882.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"6C08BE1F-5621-4EAB-813F-2545C1CEEA6A","title":"シーン 1883","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1883スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、気がつけばお昼に近くなっていて、僕は、魔理沙に断って、この家に戻ってきた。そして、取り出した本も元に戻す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1883.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"E97275E0-FBB5-4D7F-AFDF-BCB7A978C563","title":"シーン 1884","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1884スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そのまま僕が、ただぼーっとしてると誰かが駆け寄ってくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1884.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"DE398BD4-AD44-4A3F-B233-7967D638C9FA","title":"シーン 1885","duration":4.5,"slideTitle":"第1885スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「あなた、今まで何してたのよ。もうすぐお昼だから、\n部屋に行ってもフランしかいなかったし。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1885.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"D4057BA6-706D-4F94-83AB-E0F590C15C8B","title":"シーン 1886","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1886スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「魔理沙さんに、ある本について質問しに行ったんですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1886.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"2BC5981D-1D8E-4D4A-B294-C4967E26671B","title":"シーン 1887","duration":4.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1887スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「まぁ、とにかくフランとこいしを待たせるわけには行かないから、さっさと私の後についてきなさい。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1887.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/レミリア（怒る）.png"},{"id":"660E0734-518E-4821-A67E-58D07ED504F5","title":"シーン 1888","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1888スライド","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、去っていく。僕は慌てて、跡をつける。そして、昼食をとっている最中もレミリアとフランから怒られた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1888.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg"},{"id":"2868B2E7-A252-4C63-8C95-4FB4E5500989","title":"シーン 1889","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1889スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は昼食と歯磨きを済ますと、フランと僕の二人部屋で一人、ベッドに座り、休んでいた。すると部屋の扉がノックされる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1889.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd"},{"id":"0F8811B9-468D-43C1-B128-C214BD312E39","title":"シーン 1890","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1890スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どうぞ。」僕がそう言うと、部屋の扉が開く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1890.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd"},{"id":"C0F189E8-B7E4-4CE7-900A-F6013CDD15BB","title":"シーン 1891","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1891スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、部屋に入ってきたのは、こいしとフランだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1891.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"13C055AA-433F-4406-8F0D-CDC17580C294","title":"シーン 1892","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1892スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「紅夢、一緒に出かけようよ！」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1892.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"72EE0BDC-1424-407F-AD18-43A4458FFD74","title":"シーン 1893","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1893スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ？」僕がそう突如の誘いに戸惑っていると、\nフランが補足説明をする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1893.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"545F0336-EBFA-46CF-9A93-6EA595F982C1","title":"シーン 1894","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1894スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「お姉様の許可はとったから、私は、紅夢の意見に任せるよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1894.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"08C977E6-0DF2-4975-9108-11B4E1F67CCF","title":"シーン 1895","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1895スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、でも大丈夫なんですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1895.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"1430F66C-238D-4177-B93C-D0F03922F964","title":"シーン 1896","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1896スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私が、常にそばにいれば、大丈夫だよ…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1896.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"0743378B-A234-47A2-A803-322182454D61","title":"シーン 1897","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1897スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「分かりました…、それでどこに行きますか？」僕がそう言うと、彼女はある場所の名前を言い、僕たちは家を出るのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1897.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"B959C7CD-D5C1-4BCC-BB5D-6B6AAC4D7277","title":"シーン 1898","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1898スライド","backgroundName":"nc310548_遊園地.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がこいしに連れられ、やってきたのは遊園地だった。\nそして、僕はこいしあれこれと半日の間、連れ回される。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1898.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc310548_遊園地.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"0A7957F7-8AD0-492F-928C-3C53D88988BD","title":"シーン 1899","duration":5.4,"slideTitle":"第1899スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-15_13-37.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、気がつけば夕日が差し込む時間帯になっていた。\nすると、こいしが観覧車を指差しながら、あることを言う。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1899.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-15_13-37.png","