StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1902.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-15_13-37.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"4B584D6C-E6DB-4910-B9A2-E05B3DC365DF","title":"シーン 1903","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1903スライド","backgroundName":"2026-11-15_13-37.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それから観覧車乗り場に向かう。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1903.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/2026-11-15_13-37.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"DF6754ED-8096-4A97-9AD8-E63910872CE5","title":"シーン 1904","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1904スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが観覧車に乗ると、こいしがあることを聞く。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1904.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"CDCA6E4A-1231-41A2-9281-1235FCCE558B","title":"シーン 1905","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1905スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「遊園地、楽しかった？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1905.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"F7890579-B5D3-46C3-B52C-A39074E7FCED","title":"シーン 1906","duration":4.0,"slideTitle":"第1906スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「まぁまぁ…」僕は、曖昧にそう返す。\n実際のところ、楽しめたとは言い切れなかった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1906.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"4880EA1D-457B-477F-8DAD-DA94F895A22E","title":"シーン 1907","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1907スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そう…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1907.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"44EF330D-A255-485C-B9A2-B9BEBAF5E3DA","title":"シーン 1908","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1908スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちは、それから観覧車に乗るまでの空気感が一気になくなり、ただ静けさと気まずさだけに包まれていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1908.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"4E7C79EB-1C0D-469E-8730-2F4F8605B7F1","title":"シーン 1909","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1909スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そのまま、観覧車が進み、ちょうど真上にくると、観覧車の動きが突如止まる。僕は、ふと気になって立とうとする。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1909.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"5A1DA388-63AF-41C1-AEB6-AE78F283B9CE","title":"シーン 1910","duration":5.300000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1910スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、立とうとした習慣に大きな揺れがきて、僕は思わず、前のめりに倒れ、フランと間に手をつくように倒れ込む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1910.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/困った笑み.png"},{"id":"064E1196-0A70-415C-948B-37E79B6CC19D","title":"シーン 1911","duration":4.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1911スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、はっと気がつくと、元の位置に戻る。\nすると、二人は頬照った状態で固まっていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1911.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/フラン（驚く）.png"},{"id":"CCB13AF7-FAEC-4787-8BAE-DA37E8349E0B","title":"シーン 1912","duration":5.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1912スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、戸惑っていると、嫌な予感が走り、反射的にフランとこいしの間に座り込むと、二人の手をぎゅっと掴む。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1912.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/フラン（驚く）.png"},{"id":"C6140330-F2AC-4FC7-A2B4-7A6713F98CA0","title":"シーン 1913","duration":3.7,"slideTitle":"第1913スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると案の定、観覧車の扉が開き、\n明らかに様子がおかしいさとりが入ってきた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1913.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"D51590EC-1C23-4B7B-A2D1-39FA2EC13114","title":"シーン 1914","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1914スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「一体、何の用ですか？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1914.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"5D6F1D96-FBEB-45D6-B636-68893E20C519","title":"シーン 1915","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1915スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「そんなこと、決まっているではありませんか。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1915.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"2D7693D1-F574-4982-BBE4-3AFE9430F9E5","title":"シーン 1916","duration":3.8000000000000003,"slideTitle":"第1916スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言いながら、こいしに視線を当てる。\n僕は、その隙に彼女を蹴り上げる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1916.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"4E43558F-D371-4AB6-8E1D-78E50B5A8B6C","title":"シーン 1917","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1917スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、彼女は僕が蹴り上げた足を、強く蹴り返す。\nすると、僕の全身に強い衝撃が入り、気を失ってしまった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1917.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影あり微笑.png"},{"id":"BCB453D7-6B5B-419A-A264-D015724971C8","title":"シーン 1918","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1918スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「ほら、こいし、私と一緒に家に戻りましょ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1918.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"46122FFD-A785-4189-BBF7-163F5442C937","title":"シーン 1919","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1919スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"私は、ハッとして気がつくと、目の前には怖気付く少女と黒い笑みを浮かべる彼女がいた。そして、状況を察する。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1919.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"36FEA4B2-5B9A-4920-893B-5578D61EEE97","title":"シーン 1920","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"第1920スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"そして、彼女が少女を手で掴みかけると、私はその手を叩く。\nすると、彼女の動作が止まり、表情が変わる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1920.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影あり微笑2.png"},{"id":"A158A55F-0510-4E26-A2DC-97542DDEB995","title":"シーン 1921","duration":5.800000000000001,"slideTitle":"第1921スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「おや、手出しをしなければ、私は黙っていたんですがね…、仕方ありません。今日のところは引き上げましょう。では失礼。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1921.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png"},{"id":"760316CB-BD28-4469-A284-95508F778518","title":"シーン 1922","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1922スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"彼女がそう言って、立ち去ると、\n席の片隅で固まっていた彼女が話し出す。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1922.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ涙あわわ.png"},{"id":"F3BFE0C3-2BEA-470C-8226-71F4EECAF0A1","title":"シーン 1923","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1923スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「ごめんなさい…、私…、彼女に心が読まれて、抑止された…」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1923.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ涙あわわ.png"},{"id":"5CB5D12A-430A-4057-8C9E-7652A687276B","title":"シーン 1924","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1924スライド","backgroundName":"nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"彼女がそう言っていると、観覧車が再び動き始めた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1924.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/nc230674_観覧車の中（夕方）.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/帽子のみ涙あわわ.png"},{"id":"D7FA4ACE-8AF7-4859-AD4B-2D52AD093B80","title":"黒いさとり（何者かに乗っ取られた状態）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1925.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/影ありニヤケ顔.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"4D680CB3-1BD6-490E-966C-ABA19C1338E2","title":"シーン 1926","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1926スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"あれから、私たちはフランの家に戻ってくると、夕方の出来事とその出来事から推測できる事象をレミリアに伝えていた。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1926.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"3707F0B1-7145-4D59-B16E-31C0DDDD7771","title":"シーン 1927","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1927スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「これは、私の責任よ。私が外出を許可したばかりに…。にしても、厄介ね…、グループ内の派閥争いっていうものは…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1927.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"9A3F1218-0401-4894-845F-BEF55A25C730","title":"シーン 1928","duration":5.7,"slideTitle":"第1928スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「とりあえず、彼女は再び、こいしの元に現れると言ってましたから、しばらくの間は、誰か護衛をつけた方がいいですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1928.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"953762E5-E096-4030-A673-693B1025A789","title":"シーン 1929","duration":4.3,"slideTitle":"第1929スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ごめんなさいね…、あなたに頼るつもりはなかったけど、\nこんなことになってしまって…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1929.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"B3E9A126-3038-439D-9F79-29BFB3258A73","title":"シーン 1930","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1930スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「きっと次来る時も、向こうはあなたたちが吸血鬼であることを逆手にとって、逆らえないようにしてきますよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1930.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"501C131D-45E7-4D5A-9F4A-88374FC43ECA","title":"シーン 1931","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1931スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「確かに、でもあなたは大丈夫なの？文脈から察するに、あなたの存在に関する情報が、向こうに流れるみたいだけど？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1931.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"6794A30E-3853-484D-A201-F2F0E2BA1B54","title":"シーン 1932","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1932スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「それは…、別に構いませんよ。ただ、彼女に従えば、吸血鬼という情報が流れ出さないなんていう保証はありませんよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1932.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"A0F49D6D-BD4A-4A48-A8FE-DE5961EB0486","title":"シーン 1933","duration":4.2,"slideTitle":"第1933スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「その上で、この派閥争いを鎮めて、\n次のステップに踏むべきだと、私は感じますがね…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1933.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"CFB74B68-B081-4229-B83C-BB7415A2A7E9","title":"シーン 1934","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1934スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「確かにあなたのいうとおりね…。\nとりあえず、夕飯にしましょうか。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1934.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/香霖堂影あり困り.png"},{"id":"F516B417-8152-42D8-8D53-BB34C8C22160","title":"シーン 1935","duration":5.6000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1935スライド","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","characterName":"サブ","telop":"彼女はそう言い、部屋をさると、私も出る。そして、食事が終わると霊の如く、全身に衝撃が入り、彼が出てくるのだった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"サブ","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1935.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg"},{"id":"9B561B82-405D-42F6-98C1-10211ABB50AF","title":"？（霊夢の母に霖之助と呼ばれていた。そし…）","duration":5.0,"slideTitle":"中扉","backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","telop":"","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1936.jpeg","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/黒影.png","animationDuration":5.0},{"id":"1E32CE66-39DD-4DD9-9817-6C19EAA93176","title":"シーン 1937","duration":5.5,"slideTitle":"第1937スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、そこは食堂だった。すると、こいしが驚いた様子で僕を見る。「どうしたんですか、こいしさん？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1937.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ驚き.png"},{"id":"F58B402E-AF15-4B53-B676-A577A274CAAE","title":"シーン 1938","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1938スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「何でもないよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1938.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ微笑.png"},{"id":"C8FB28F8-E351-4F83-B91C-C644F001E9C7","title":"シーン 1939","duration":5.2,"slideTitle":"第1939スライド","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…」僕はそう呟くと、既に空になっている食器を片付け、歯を磨くと、そのまま二人部屋に向かった。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1939.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第11話/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ微笑.png"},{"id":"B0989B0A-D35E-4A84-B3DC-F29FC9843C4F","title":"シーン 1940","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1940スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が二人部屋に来ると、こいしがあることを聞いてくる。","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1940.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ微笑.png"},{"id":"9DC8E7E8-4EC3-46DE-9BB6-7E6E6B02178A","title":"シーン 1941","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第1941スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ねぇ、紅夢くんは誰か、好きな人はいるの？」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1941.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ微笑.png"},{"id":"68783BB5-5134-4C47-A65A-AC6DDA5F493D","title":"シーン 1942","duration":5.9,"slideTitle":"第1942スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ？」僕は、思わずそう返す。だが、しばらく考えてからいう。「この部屋は、元々フランと僕の二人部屋だったんですよ。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1942.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/パジャマ微笑.png"},{"id":"F7326B0B-78E5-4B6D-9BF1-A03EEFDEE877","title":"シーン 1943","duration":4.1000000000000005,"slideTitle":"第1943スライド","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそういうと、彼女の頬が頰照る。\n「僕は、単純にただ事実を述べただけですけど…。」","animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0.0,"bgmVolume":0.7,"seStartTimeOffset":0.0,"seVolume":1.0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0.0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"slideImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_slides/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1943.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常　第12話/2026-10-26_19-50.png","characterImagePath":"/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/TohoStudio/.cache/keynote_extracted/元女子校の日常総集編/頬照り小口開け.png"},{"id":"D4